#: about.php include/global_arrays.php include/top_general_header.php
#: include/top_header.php lib/html.php
msgid "About Cacti"
msgstr "Malunga neCacti"

#: about.php
msgid "Cacti is designed to be a complete graphing solution based on the RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) and Graphing solution. Its goal is to make the Network Administrator's job easier by taking care of all the important details necessary to create meaningful Graphs."
msgstr "ICacti yenzelwe ukuba ibe sisixhobo esipheleleyo sokwenza iigrafu esisekelwe kwi-RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) kunye nesisombululo sokwenza iigrafu. Injongo yayo kukwenza umsebenzi woMlawuli woThungelwano ube lula ngokuthatha uxanduva lwazo zonke iinkcukacha ezibalulekileyo eziyimfuneko ukuze kwenziwe Iigrafu ezinentsingiselo."

#: about.php
#, php-format
msgid "Please see the official %sCacti website%s for information on how to use Cacti, get support, and updates."
msgstr "Nceda ujonge %1$siwebhusayithi yeCacti%2$s esemthethweni ukuze ufumane ulwazi malunga nendlela yokusebenzisa iCacti, ukufumana uncedo, kunye nohlaziyo."

#: about.php
msgid "Active Developers"
msgstr "Abaphuhlisi Abasebenzayo"

#: about.php
msgid "Developers working on Cacti, its Architecture, Documentation and Future Releases."
msgstr "Abaphuhlisi abasebenza kwiCacti, uYilo lwayo, Amaxwebhu kunye noKhupho lwexesha elizayo."

#: about.php
msgid "Honorable Mentions"
msgstr "Abakhankanywe Ngembeko"

#: about.php
msgid "Contributors to Documentation, QA, Packaging, the Forums and our YouTube page."
msgstr "Abaxhasi kuMaxwebhu, kwi-QA, kuPakisho, kwiiForam kunye nephepha lethu le-YouTube."

#: about.php
msgid "Emeritus Members"
msgstr "Amalungu Angaphambili Anembeko"

#: about.php
msgid "Members of the original Cacti Group that have since moved on in their careers.  We continue to wish them the best."
msgstr "Amalungu eqela lokuqala leCacti asele eqhubele phambili kwimisebenzi yawo. Siyaqhubeka siwanqwenelela okuhle."

#: about.php
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr "Imibulelo"

#: about.php
#, php-format
msgid "A very special thanks to %sTobi Oetiker%s, the creator of %sRRDtool%s and the very popular %sMRTG%s."
msgstr "Umbulelo okhethekileyo ku-%1$sTobi Oetiker%2$s, umyili we-%3$sRRDtool%4$s kunye ne-%5$sMRTG%6$s edume kakhulu."

#: about.php
msgid "The users of Cacti"
msgstr "Abasebenzisi beCacti"

#: about.php
msgid "Especially anyone who has taken the time to create an issue report, or otherwise help fix a Cacti related problems. Also to anyone who has contributed to supporting Cacti."
msgstr "Ngakumbi nabani na othathe ixesha lokwenza ingxelo yengxaki, okanye oncede ngandlela ithile ukulungisa iingxaki ezinxulumene neCacti. Kwakhona nabani na othe wafaka isandla ekuxhaseni iCacti."

#: about.php
msgid "License"
msgstr "Ilayisensi"

#: about.php
msgid "Cacti is licensed under the GNU GPL:"
msgstr "ICacti inelayisensi phantsi kwe-GNU GPL:"

#: about.php lib/installer.php
msgid "This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation; either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later version."
msgstr "Le nkqubo yisoftware simahla; ungayisasaza kwakhona kwaye/okanye uyitshintshe phantsi kwemiqathango ye-GNU General Public License njengoko ipapashwe yi-Free Software Foundation; mhlawumbi inguqulelo yesi-2 yeLayisensi, okanye (ngokukhetha kwakho) nayiphi na inguqulelo yamva."

#: about.php
msgid "This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details."
msgstr "Le nkqubo isasazwa ngethemba lokuba iya kuba luncedo, kodwa NGAPHANDLE KWASIPHI NA ISIQINISEKISO; kwanangaphandle kwesiqinisekiso esichaziweyo sokuTHENGISEKA okanye UKUFANELEKA KWINJONGO ETHILE. Jonga i-GNU General Public License ukuze ufumane iinkcukacha ezithe vetshe."

