msgid "Represents the final desired Device description to be used in Cacti.  The following replacement values can be used: |sysName|, |ipAddress|, |dnsName|, |dnsShortName|, |sysLocation|.  The following functions can also be used: CONCAT(), SUBSTRING(), SUBSTRING_INDEX().  See the MySQL/MariaDB documentation for examples on how to use these functions.  An example would be: CONCAT('|sysName|', SUBSTRING('|sysLocation|',1,3)).  Take care to include quoting around the variables names when used in the supported MySQL/MariaDB function examples."
msgstr "Imela inkcazelo yokugqibela efunwayo yeSixhobo eza kusetyenziswa kwi-Cacti. La maxabiso alandelayo okutshintsha angasetyenziswa: |sysName|, |ipAddress|, |dnsName|, |dnsShortName|, |sysLocation|. Le misebenzi ilandelayo inokusetyenziswa kwakhona: CONCAT(), SUBSTRING(), SUBSTRING_INDEX(). Jonga amaxwebhu e-MySQL/MariaDB ngemizekelo yendlela yokusebenzisa le misebenzi. Umzekelo unokuba ngu: CONCAT('|sysName|', SUBSTRING('|sysLocation|',1,3)). Qaphela ukufaka iikowuti malunga namagama eziguquguquki xa zisetyenziswa kwimizekelo yemisebenzi ye-MySQL/MariaDB exhaswayo."

