msgstr "Iinketho Zegridi"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Grid Value (--unit/--y-grid)"
msgstr "Ixabiso Legridi Yeyunithi (--unit/--y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Sets the exponent value on the Y-axis for numbers. Note: This option is deprecated and replaced by the --y-grid option.  In this option, Y-axis grid lines appear at each grid step interval.  Labels are placed every label factor lines."
msgstr "Imisela ixabiso le-eksponenti kwi-asi ka-Y yamanani. Qaphela: Olu khetho alusasetyenziswa kwaye luthatyathelwe indawo lukhetho lwe--y-grid. Kolu khetho, imigca yegridi ye-asi ka-Y ivela kwisithuba ngasinye senyathelo legridi. Iilebhile zibekwa emva kwemigca engange-label factor nganye."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Exponent Value (--units-exponent)"
msgstr "Ixabiso Le-eksponenti Yeyunithi (--units-exponent)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "What unit Cacti should use on the Y-axis. Use 3 to display everything in \"k\" or -6 to display everything in \"u\" (micro)."
msgstr "Yeyiphi iyunithi ekufuneka iCacti iyisebenzise kwi-asi ka-Y. Sebenzisa u-3 ukubonisa yonke into ngo-\"k\" okanye u--6 ukubonisa yonke into ngo-\"u\" (imayikhro)."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Length (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"
msgstr "Ubude Beyunithi (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How many digits should RRDtool assume the y-axis labels to be? You may have to use this option to make enough space once you start fiddling with the y-axis labeling."
msgstr "Mangaphi amanani ekufuneka i-RRDtool icinge ukuba iilebhile ze-asi ka-y zinawo? Kungafuneka usebenzise olu khetho ukwenza isithuba esaneleyo xa sele uqalisa ukuhlengahlengisa ukubhalwa kwelebhile ye-asi ka-y."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "No Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"
msgstr "Akukho Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "In order to avoid anti-aliasing blurring effects RRDtool snaps points to device resolution pixels, this results in a crisper appearance. If this is not to your liking, you can use this switch to turn this behavior off.<br><strong>Note: </strong>Gridfitting is turned off for PDF, EPS, SVG output by default."
msgstr "Ukuze kuphetshwe iziphumo zokufiphalisa ezibangelwa yi-anti-aliasing, i-RRDtool itsalela amanqaku kwiiphikseli zesisombululo sesixhobo, oku kubangela inkangeleko ecacileyo. Ukuba oku akukuthandi, ungasebenzisa esi switshi ukucima oku kuziphatha.<br><strong>Qaphela: </strong>I-Gridfitting icinyiwe kwimveliso ye-PDF, EPS, SVG ngokungagqibekanga."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Alternative Y Grid (--alt-y-grid)"
msgstr "Igridi Enye ka-Y (--alt-y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The algorithm ensures that you always have a grid, that there are enough but not too many grid lines, and that the grid is metric. This parameter will also ensure that you get enough decimals displayed even if your graph goes from 69.998 to 70.001.<br><strong>Note: </strong>This parameter may interfere with --alt-autoscale options."
msgstr "I-algorithim iqinisekisa ukuba uhlala unegridi, ukuba kukho imigca yegridi eyaneleyo kodwa engabi mininzi kakhulu, kwaye igridi iyimetrikhi. Le pharamitha iya kuqinisekisa kwakhona ukuba ufumana amanani edesimali aneleyo aboniswayo nokuba igrafu yakho isuka ku-69.998 ukuya ku-70.001.<br><strong>Qaphela: </strong>Le pharamitha inokuphazamisana neenketho ze--alt-autoscale."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Axis Options"
msgstr "Iinketho Ze-asi"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"
msgstr "I-asi Yasekunene (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A second axis will be drawn to the right of the graph. It is tied to the left axis via the scale and shift parameters."
msgstr "I-asi yesibini iya kuzotywa ngasekunene kwegrafu. Idityaniswe ne-asi yasekhohlo ngeepharamitha ze-scale ne-shift."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"
msgstr "Ilebhile Ye-asi Yasekunene (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The label for the right axis."
msgstr "Ilebhile ye-asi yasekunene."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label Angle (--right-axis-label-angle)"
msgstr "I-engile Yelebhile Ye-asi Yasekunene (--right-axis-label-angle)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right label rotation in degrees counter clockwise. Requires RRDtool 1.11 or newer. Blank follows the vertical label angle. Angles other than 90 and 270 may overlap nearby content."
msgstr "Ukujikeleziswa kwelebhile yasekunene ngeedigri ngokuchasene nokuhamba kwewotshi. Ifuna i-RRDtool 1.11 okanye entsha. Ukuba ishiywe ingenanto ilandela i-engile yelebhile ethe nkqo. Ii-engile ezingezizo ezingama-90 nezingama-270 zinokugquma umxholo okufutshane."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label Range (--right-axis-range)"
msgstr "Uluhlu Lwelebhile Ye-asi Yasekunene (--right-axis-range)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Only show right axis labels within min:max, for example 0:100. Either bound may be blank. This does not change the axis scale. Requires RRDtool 1.11 or newer. Blank leaves labels unrestricted."
msgstr "Bonisa kuphela iilebhile ze-asi yasekunene ngaphakathi kwe-min:max, umzekelo u-0:100. Nawuphi na umda unokushiywa ungenanto. Oku akusitshintshi isikali se-asi. Ifuna i-RRDtool 1.11 okanye entsha. Ukuba ishiywe ingenanto ishiya iilebhile zingathintelwanga."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Format (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Ifomathi Ye-asi Yasekunene (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "By default, the format of the axis labels gets determined automatically.  If you want to do this yourself, use this option with the same %lf arguments you know from the PRINT and GPRINT commands."
msgstr "Ngokungagqibekanga, ifomathi yeelebheli ze-eksisi imiselwa ngokuzenzekelayo. Ukuba ufuna ukuzenzela oku ngokwakho, sebenzisa olu khetho kunye ii-arguments ezifanayo ze-%lf ozaziyo kwimiyalelo ye-PRINT kunye ne-GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Formatter (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Isifomathi se-Eksisi yaseKunene (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the right axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length and --right-axis-format.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Xa useta iilebheli ze-eksisi yasekunene, sebenzisa umgaqo kwifomathi yedatha. Iifomathi ezixhaswayo ziquka i-\"numeric\" apho idatha iphathwa njengamanani, i-\"timestamp\" apho amaxabiso atolikwa njengezibonisi-xesha ze-UNIX (inani lemizuzwana ukususela ngoJanyuwari 1970) kwaye achazwa kusetyenziswa ifomathi ye-strftime (okungagqibekanga ngu-\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"). Jonga kwakhona ku --units-length naku --right-axis-format. Ekugqibeleni i-\"duration\" apho amaxabiso atolikwa njengobude bexesha ngeemilisekondi. Ukufomatha kulandela imigaqo ye-PRINT/GPRINT eqinisekiswe nge-valstrfduration."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Left Axis Format (--left-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "IFomathi ye-Eksisi yaseKhohlo (--left-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Left Axis Formatter (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Isifomathi se-Eksisi yaseKhohlo (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the left axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Xa useta iilebheli ze-eksisi yasekhohlo, sebenzisa umgaqo kwifomathi yedatha. Iifomathi ezixhaswayo ziquka i-\"numeric\" apho idatha iphathwa njengamanani, i-\"timestamp\" apho amaxabiso atolikwa njengezibonisi-xesha ze-UNIX (inani lemizuzwana ukususela ngoJanyuwari 1970) kwaye achazwa kusetyenziswa ifomathi ye-strftime (okungagqibekanga ngu-\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"). Jonga kwakhona ku --units-length. Ekugqibeleni i-\"duration\" apho amaxabiso atolikwa njengobude bexesha ngeemilisekondi. Ukufomatha kulandela imigaqo ye-PRINT/GPRINT eqinisekiswe nge-valstrfduration."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Options"
msgstr "Ukhetho lweLejendi"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Padding"
msgstr "Ukongeza iZithuba ngokuZenzekelayo"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Pad text so that legend and graph data always line up. Note: this could cause graphs to take longer to render because of the larger overhead. Also Auto Padding may not be accurate on all types of graphs, consistent labeling usually helps."
msgstr "Yongeza izithuba kwiteksti ukuze ilejendi nedatha yegrafu zihlale zilungelelene. Qaphela: oku kunokubangela ukuba iigrafu zithathe ixesha elide ukuzotywa ngenxa yomthwalo omkhulu wokusebenza. Kwakhona Ukongeza iZithuba ngokuZenzekelayo kunokungachaneki kuzo zonke iintlobo zeegrafu, ukulebhela okungaguqukiyo kudla ngokunceda."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dynamic Labels (--dynamic-labels)"
msgstr "Iilebheli eziGuquguqukayo (--dynamic-labels)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Draw line markers as a line."
msgstr "Zoba iimpawu zomgca njengomgca."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Force Rules Legend (--force-rules-legend)"
msgstr "Nyanzela iLejendi yeMigaqo (--force-rules-legend)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Force the generation of HRULE and VRULE legends."
msgstr "Nyanzela ukuveliswa kweelejendi ze-HRULE kunye ne-VRULE."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Tab Width (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"
msgstr "Ububanzi beThebhu (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "By default the tab-width is 40 pixels, use this option to change it."
msgstr "Ngokungagqibekanga ububanzi bethebhu zii-pixels ezingama-40, sebenzisa olu khetho ukubutshintsha."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Position (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"
msgstr "Indawo yeLejendi (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Place the legend at the given side of the graph."
msgstr "Beka ilejendi kwicala elinikiweyo legrafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Direction (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"
msgstr "Umkhombandlela weLejendi (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Place the legend items in the given vertical order."
msgstr "Beka izinto zelejendi ngolandelelwano olume nkqo olunikiweyo."

#: include/global_form.php lib/api_aggregate.php
msgid "Graph Item Type"
msgstr "Uhlobo lweNto yeGrafu"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How data for this item is represented visually on the graph."
msgstr "Indlela idatha yale nto eboniswa ngayo ngokubonakalayo kwigrafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The data source to use for this graph item."
msgstr "Umthombo wedatha omele ukusetyenziselwa le nto yegrafu."

#: include/global_form.php lib/html.php
msgid "Primary Color"
msgstr "Umbala oPhambili"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The color to use for the canvas item and legend."
msgstr "Umbala omele ukusetyenziselwa into yekhanvasi kunye nelejendi."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Primary Opacity"
msgstr "I-Opacity ePhambili"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The opacity of the primary color."
msgstr "I-opacity yombala ophambili."

#: include/global_form.php lib/html.php
msgid "Gradient Color"
msgstr "Umbala weGrediyenti"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The gradient color to use for the canvas item."
msgstr "Umbala wegrediyenti omele ukusetyenziselwa into yekhanvasi."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Gradient Opacity"
msgstr "I-Opacity yeGrediyenti"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The opacity of the gradient color."
msgstr "I-opacity yombala wegrediyenti."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Gradient Height"
msgstr "Ubude beGrediyenti"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The Gradient Height parameter can create three different behaviors. If it is > 0, then the gradient is a fixed height, starting at the line going down. If it is < 0, then the gradient starts at a fixed height above the x-axis, going down to the x-axis. If it is == 0, then the gradient goes from the top of the area fill to x-axis."
msgstr "Ipharamitha yoBude beGrediyenti inokudala iindlela zokuziphatha ezintathu ezahlukeneyo. Ukuba > 0, ngoko igrediyenti inobude obusisigxina, iqala kumgca isihla ezantsi. Ukuba < 0, ngoko igrediyenti iqala kubude obusisigxina ngaphezu kwe-eksisi ye-x, isihla iye kwi-eksisi ye-x. Ukuba == 0, ngoko igrediyenti isuka phezulu kwindawo egcwalisiweyo iye kwi-eksisi ye-x."

#: include/global_form.php lib/rrd.php
msgid "Consolidation Function"
msgstr "Umsebenzi woHlanganiso"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How data for this item is represented statistically on the graph."
msgstr "Indlela idatha yale nto emelwa ngayo ngokwamanani kwigrafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "CDEF Function"
msgstr "Umsebenzi we-CDEF"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A CDEF (math) function to apply to this item on the graph or legend."
msgstr "Umsebenzi we-CDEF (wemathematika) omele ukusetyenziswa kule nto kwigrafu okanye kwilejendi."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "VDEF Function"
msgstr "Umsebenzi we-VDEF"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A VDEF (math) function to apply to this item on the graph legend."
msgstr "Umsebenzi we-VDEF (wemathematika) omele ukusetyenziswa kule nto kwilejendi yegrafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Shift Data"
msgstr "Shenxisa iDatha"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Offset your data on the time axis (x-axis) by the amount specified in the 'value' field."
msgstr "Shenxisa idatha yakho kwi-eksisi yexesha (i-eksisi ye-x) ngesixa esichazwe kwindawo ethi 'value'."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "[HRULE|VRULE]: The value of the graph item.<br/> [TICK]: The fraction for the tick line.<br/> [SHIFT]: The time offset in seconds."
msgstr "[HRULE|VRULE]: Ixabiso lento yegrafu.<br/> [TICK]: Iqhezu lomgca wokuphawula.<br/> [SHIFT]: Ukushenxiswa kwexesha ngemizuzwana."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "GPRINT Type"
msgstr "Uhlobo lwe-GPRINT"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "If this graph item is a GPRINT, you can optionally choose another format here. You can define additional types under \"GPRINT Presets\"."
msgstr "Ukuba le nto yegrafu yi-GPRINT, unokuzikhethela enye ifomathi apha. Unokuchaza ezinye iintlobo phantsi ko-\"GPRINT Presets\"."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text Alignment (TEXTALIGN)"
msgstr "Ulungelelwaniso lweTeksti (TEXTALIGN)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "All subsequent legend line(s) will be aligned as given here.  You may use this command multiple times in a single graph.  This command does not produce tabular layout.<br/><strong>Note: </strong>You may want to insert a &lt;HR&gt; on the preceding graph item.<br/> <strong>Note: </strong>A &lt;HR&gt; on this legend line will obsolete this setting!"
msgstr "Yonke imigca elandelayo yelejendi iya kulungelelaniswa njengoko kunikiwe apha. Ungawusebenzisa lo myalelo izihlandlo ezininzi kwigrafu enye. Lo myalelo awuvelisi uyilo olufana netheyibhile.<br/><strong>Qaphela: </strong>Ungafuna ukufaka i-&lt;HR&gt; kwinto yegrafu engaphambili.<br/> <strong>Qaphela: </strong>I-&lt;HR&gt; kulo mgca welejendi iya kwenza olu seto lungasebenzi!"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text Format"
msgstr "IFomathi yeTeksti"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text that will be displayed on the legend for this graph item."
msgstr "Iteksti eya kuboniswa kwilejendi yale nto yegrafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend for Export/Hover"
msgstr "ILejendi yokuThumela ngaphandle/yokuBeka ngaphezulu"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A Legend to be displayed when Hovering over the Graph and also used for Graph Export.  Hover requires RRDtool 1.9.1 and above.  It may work for RRDtool 1.8+, but not for Thold Legends."
msgstr "ILejendi emele ukuboniswa xa ubeka isikhombisi ngaphezu kweGrafu kwaye isetyenziselwa ukuThumela iGrafu ngaphandle. Ukubeka isikhombisi ngaphezulu kufuna i-RRDtool 1.9.1 nangaphezulu. Ingasebenza kwi-RRDtool 1.8+, kodwa hayi kwiiLejendi ze-Thold."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Insert Hard Return"
msgstr "Faka uQhawulo-mgca"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Forces the legend to the next line after this item."
msgstr "Inyanzela ilejendi ukuba iye kumgca olandelayo emva kwale nto."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Line Width (decimal)"
msgstr "Ububanzi boMgca (idesimali)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "In case LINE was chosen, specify width of line here.  You must include a decimal precision, for example 2.00"
msgstr "Ukuba kukhethwe i-LINE, chaza ububanzi bomgca apha. Kufuneka ubandakanye ukuchaneka kwedesimali, umzekelo 2.00"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dashes (dashes[=on_s[,off_s[,on_s,off_s]...]])"
msgstr "Imigca eqhawukileyo (dashes[=on_s[,off_s[,on_s,off_s]...]])"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The dashes modifier enables dashed line style."
msgstr "Isihlengahlengisi se-dashes senza isitayile somgca oqhawukileyo sisebenze."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dash Offset (dash-offset=offset)"
msgstr "Ukugudluzwa komgca oqhawukileyo (dash-offset=offset)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The dash-offset parameter specifies an offset into the pattern at which the stroke begins."
msgstr "Ipharamitha ye-dash-offset ichaza umgama wokugudluzwa kwipatheni apho umgca uqala khona."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The name given to this graph template."
msgstr "Igama elinikwe le thempleyithi yegrafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The Class of this Graph Template."
msgstr "Udidi lwale Thempleyithi yeGrafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The Version given to this Graph Template."
msgstr "Inguqulelo enikwe le Thempleyithi yeGrafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Multiple Instances"
msgstr "Iimeko eziNinzi"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if there can be more than one Graph of this type per Device."
msgstr "Phawula le bhokisi yokutshekisha ukuba kunokubakho iGrafu engaphezu kwenye yolu hlobo kwiSixhobo ngasinye."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Test Data Sources"
msgstr "Vavanya iMithombo yeDatha"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Phawula le bhokisi yokutshekisha ukuba ufuna ukuvavanya iMithombo yeDatha phambi kokuba yenziwe. Xa ukuVavanya iMithombo yeDatha kuvuliwe, ukuba uMthombo weDatha awubuyisi datha esebenzayo, iGrafu ayiyi kwenziwa. Olu seto lubalulekile ukuba ufuna ukuba neThempleyithi yeSixhobo eqhelekileyo enokubandakanya iiThempleyithi zeGrafu ezingakumbi ezinokusetyenziswa ngokukhetha ngokuxhomekeke kwiimpawu zeSixhobo ngokwaso. Qaphela: Ukuba unesikripthi esithatha ixesha elide njengoMthombo weDatha, ixesha lokwenza iiGrafu liya kunyuka."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter a name for this graph item input, make sure it is something you recognize."
msgstr "Faka igama loku kufakwa kwento yegrafu, qinisekisa ukuba yinto oyiqondayo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter a description for this graph item input to describe what this input is used for."
msgstr "Faka inkcazelo yoku kufakwa kwento yegrafu ukuchaza ukuba oku kufakwa kusetyenziselwa ntoni."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Field Type"
msgstr "Uhlobo lweFildi"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How data is to be represented on the graph."
msgstr "Indlela idatha eya kuboniswa ngayo kwigrafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "General Device Options"
msgstr "Iinketho zeSixhobo eziQhelekileyo"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Give this host a meaningful description."
msgstr "Nika le hosti inkcazelo enentsingiselo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Fully qualified hostname or IP address for this device. IPv6 address insert into brackets (example: [2001:abcd:1234::1])"
msgstr "Igama lehosti elipheleleyo okanye idilesi ye-IP yesi sixhobo. Idilesi ye-IPv6 ifake kwizibiyeli (umzekelo: [2001:abcd:1234::1])"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The physical location of the Device.  This free-form text can be a room, rack location, etc."
msgstr "Indawo ebonakalayo ekuyo iSixhobo. Lo mbhalo okhululekileyo unokuba ligumbi, indawo yereki, njl."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Poller Association"
msgstr "Unxulumano lwe-Poller"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Device Site Association"
msgstr "Unxulumano lweSayithi yeSixhobo"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "What Site is this Device associated with."
msgstr "Yeyiphi iSayithi esiSixhobo sinxulunyaniswe nayo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Choose the Device Template to use to define the default Graph Templates and Data Queries associated with this Device."
msgstr "Khetha iThempleyithi yeSixhobo oza kuyisebenzisa ukuchaza iiThempleyithi zeGrafu ezimiselweyo kunye neMibuzo yeDatha enxulumene nesi Sixhobo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Number of Collection Threads"
msgstr "Inani leeThredi zokuQokelela"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The number of concurrent threads to use for polling this device.  This applies to the Spine poller only."
msgstr "Inani leethredi ezisebenza ngexesha elinye eziza kusetyenziselwa ukuvota esi sixhobo. Oku kusebenza kwi-poller ye-Spine kuphela."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Check this box to disable all checks for this host."
msgstr "Phawula le bhokisi ukuze uvale zonke iitshekhi zale hosti."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Availability/Reachability Options"
msgstr "Iinketho zokuFumaneka/zokuFikeleleka"

#: include/global_form.php include/global_settings.php
msgid "Downed Device Detection"
msgstr "Ukufumanisa iSixhobo esiWileyo"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The method Cacti will use to determine if a host is available for polling.  <br><i>NOTE: It is recommended that, at a minimum, SNMP always be selected.</i>"
