#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Log Actions"
msgstr "Izenzo zeLogi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What Log Actions do you wish to provide to the Cacti Administrator.  You can grant either purge, rotate, or both purge and rotate.  Base files can be both purged and rotated, and already rotated files can only be purged if you grant that permission."
msgstr "Zeziphi iZenzo zeLogi onqwenela ukuzinika uMlawuli we-Cacti. Unganika imvume yokucima ngokupheleleyo, ukujikelezisa, okanye zombini ukucima nokujikelezisa. Iifayile ezisisiseko zinokucinywa kwaye zijikeleziswe, kwaye iifayile esele zijikelezisiwe zinokucinywa kuphela ukuba unika loo mvume."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Generic Log Level"
msgstr "Inqanaba leLogi eliQhelekileyo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What level of detail do you want sent to the log file.  WARNING: Leaving in any other status than NONE or LOW can exhaust your disk space rapidly."
msgstr "Leliphi inqanaba leenkcukacha ofuna lithunyelwe kwifayile yelogi. ISILUMKISO: Ukushiya nakweliphi na elinye inqanaba ngaphandle kwe-NONE okanye i-LOW kunokugqiba isithuba sediski yakho ngokukhawuleza."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expand log details"
msgstr "Yandisa iinkcukacha zelogi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What level of expansion do you want on the log file? Increase expansion can slow search results"
