#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Permission Method"
msgstr "Indlela Yemvume Yegrafu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are four methods for determining a User's Graph Permissions.  The first is 'Permissive'.  Under the 'Permissive' setting, a User only needs access to either the Graph, Device or Graph Template to gain access to the Graphs that apply to them.  Under 'Restrictive', the User must have access to the Graph, the Device, and the Graph Template to gain access to the Graph.  These first two methods have scalability problems for very large installs.  So, two additional options are available.  They are 'Device Based', which means if you have access to the Device, you get access to it's Graphs.  And lastly 'Graph Template Based', which means if you have access to the 'Graph Template' you get access to all Device Graphs of that Template."
msgstr "Kukho iindlela ezine zokumisela iimvume zegrafu zomsebenzisi. Eyokuqala yi-'Evumelayo'. Phantsi kwesethingi 'Evumelayo', umsebenzisi ufuna kuphela ukufikelela kwigrafu, isixhobo okanye itempleyithi yegrafu ukuze afikelele kwiigrafu ezisebenza kuye. Phantsi kwe-'Ethintelayo', umsebenzisi kufuneka abe nokufikelela kwigrafu, isixhobo, kunye netempleyithi yegrafu ukuze afikelele kwigrafu. Ezi ndlela zimbini zokuqala zineengxaki zokwandiseka kufakelo olukhulu kakhulu. Ngoko ke, kukho iinketho ezimbini ezongezelelweyo. Zezi 'Esekelwe Kwisixhobo', nto leyo ethetha ukuba ukuba unokufikelela kwisixhobo, ufumana ukufikelela kwiigrafu zaso. Kwaye okokugqibela 'Esekelwe Kwitempleyithi Yegrafu', nto leyo ethetha ukuba ukuba unokufikelela kwi-'Itempleyithi Yegrafu' ufumana ukufikelela kuzo zonke iigrafu zesixhobo zaloo templeyithi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Permissive"
msgstr "Evumelayo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Restrictive"
msgstr "Ethintelayo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Based"
msgstr "Esekelwe Kwisixhobo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph/Data Source Creation Method"
msgstr "Indlela Yokuyila Igrafu/Umthombo Wedatha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set to Simple, Graphs and Data Sources can only be created from New Graphs.  If Advanced, legacy Graph and Data Source creation is supported."
msgstr "Ukuba isetelwe ku-Elula, iigrafu kunye nemithombo yedatha zinokuyilwa kuphela ukusuka kwiigrafu ezintsha. Ukuba ngu-Ehambele phambili, ukuyilwa kwegrafu nomthombo wedatha wakudala kuyaxhaswa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Simple"
msgstr "Elula"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Ehambele phambili"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show Form/Setting Help Inline"
msgstr "Bonisa Uncedo Lwefom/Lwesethingi Ngaphakathi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, Form and Setting Help will be show inline.  Otherwise it will be presented when hovering over the help button."
msgstr "Xa ikhangelwe, uncedo lwefom nolwesethingi luya kuboniswa ngaphakathi. Kungenjalo luya kuboniswa xa uhambisa imouse phezu kweqhosha loncedo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Page Help Only"
msgstr "Uncedo Lwephepha Lwasekhaya Kuphela"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default Cacti page help is located at docs.cacti.net.  However, if your system does not have access to the Internet, you may download the documentation locally in HTML format and host it in the 'docs' location of you Cacti server.  If you choose only to leverage the local location for page help documentation, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Ngokungagqibekanga uncedo lwephepha lwe-Cacti lufumaneka ku-docs.cacti.net. Nangona kunjalo, ukuba inkqubo yakho ayinakufikelela kwi-Intanethi, ungakhuphela amaxwebhu ekuhlaleni ngefomathi ye-HTML uze uwagcine kwindawo ye-'docs' yeseva yakho ye-Cacti. Ukuba ukhetha ukusebenzisa indawo yasekhaya kuphela kumaxwebhu oncedo lwephepha, khangela le bhokisi yokutshekisha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Deletion Verification"
msgstr "Ukuqinisekiswa Kokucima"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Prompt user before item deletion."
msgstr "Buza umsebenzisi phambi kokucima into."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Preservation Preset"
msgstr "Useto Lwangaphambili Lokugcinwa Komthombo Wedatha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Cacti will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Xa yenziwe yasebenza, i-Cacti iya kuseta iqhosha lerediyo ukuba licime imithombo yedatha enxulumeneyo yegrafu xa kushenxiswa iigrafu. Qaphela: I-Cacti ayizukuvumela ukushenxiswa kwemithombo yedatha ukuba isetyenziswa kwezinye iigrafu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graphs Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Ukuvula Ngokuzenzekelayo Kweegrafu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will not lock Graphs.  This allow a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Xa yenziwe yasebenza, i-Cacti ayizukutshixa iigrafu. Oku kuvumela ukuguqulwa ngokukhawuleza ngesandla kwemithombo yedatha enxulumene negrafu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Cacti Dashboard"
msgstr "Fihla Ideshibhodi Ye-Cacti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "For use with Cacti's External Link Support.  Using this setting, you can hide the Cacti Dashboard, so you can display just your own page."
msgstr "Ukusetyenziswa kunye neNkxaso yeKhonkco laNgaphandle ye-Cacti. Ngokusebenzisa le sethingi, unokufihla ideshibhodi ye-Cacti, ukuze ubonise iphepha lakho kuphela."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Drag-N-Drop"
msgstr "Vumela Ukutsala Nokulahla"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Some of Cacti's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired user, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Eminye imijelo ye-Cacti iyaxhasa Ukutsala Nokulahla. Ukuba ikhangelwe le nketho iya kwenziwa isebenze. Qaphela: Kubasebenzisi abangaboniyo kakuhle, le nketho inokuvalwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "GitHub/GitLab API Settings"
msgstr "Iisethingi Ze-API Ye-GitHub/GitLab"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Base API Repository URL"
msgstr "I-URL Yesiseko Yendawo Yokugcina Ye-API"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to get the latest plguins versions directly from GitHub or GitLab enter the GitHub or GitLab API url here.  The default is https://api.github.com/.  Change this only if you have your own repository that you maintain for Cacti Plugins."
msgstr "Ukuba ufuna ukufumana iinguqulelo zamva nje zeeplagini ngqo ukusuka kwi-GitHub okanye kwi-GitLab, faka i-URL ye-API ye-GitHub okanye ye-GitLab apha. Okungagqibekanga ngu-https://api.github.com/. Tshintsha oku kuphela ukuba unendawo yakho yokugcina oyigcinela iiplagini ze-Cacti."

