msgstr "Buyisela Iipateni Zexabiso Eliphakanyisiweyo"

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Replace Data Source and Graph Template Suggested Value Records.  Graphs and Data Sources will take on new names after either a Data Query Reindex or by using the forced Replace Suggested Values process."
msgstr "Buyisela iirekhodi zexabiso eliphakanyisiweyo lomthombo wedatha kunye netempleyithi yegrafu. Iigrafu kunye nemithombo yedatha ziya kuthatha amagama amatsha emva kokuhlelwa kwakhona komkhombandlela wombuzo wedatha okanye ngokusebenzisa inkqubo enyanzelisiweyo yokubuyisela amaxabiso aphakanyisiweyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Ukhuseleko Lwesayithi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Nyanzela Unxibelelwano nge-HTTPS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Cacti will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Xa ikhangelwe, naziphi na iinzame zokufikelela kwi-Cacti ziya kuthunyelwa kwi-HTTPS ukuqinisekisa ukhuseleko oluphezulu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Inline JavaScript Protection"
msgstr "Ukhuseleko Lwe-JavaScript Engaphakathi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls how the Content-Security-Policy restricts inline JavaScript.  HTMX keeps the 'unsafe-inline' policy that all current themes and plugins rely on and matches the behaviour of prior releases.  Nonce Migration emits a strict nonce policy in report-only mode so incompatible core and plugin scripts can be identified without breaking the UI.  Nonce Enforcement blocks scripts without the request nonce and requires CACTI_CSP_NONCE_ENFORCE to be true in include/config.php; without that explicit gate it safely remains in report-only mode.  None also permits unsafe eval() calls and is the least restrictive option."
msgstr "Ilawula indlela i-Content-Security-Policy ethintela ngayo i-JavaScript engaphakathi.  I-HTMX igcina umgaqo-nkqubo we-'unsafe-inline' axhomekeke kuwo onke amaphepha-mkhangelelo angoku kunye neeplagi kwaye ihambelana nokuziphatha kwenguqulelo zangaphambili.  Ukufuduka kwe-Nonce kukhupha umgaqo-nkqubo ongqongqo we-nonce kwimowudi yokunika ingxelo kuphela ukuze izikripthi ezingahambelaniyo zombindi kunye neeplagi zikwazi ukuchongwa ngaphandle kokwaphula i-UI.  Ukunyanzeliswa kwe-Nonce kuvala izikripthi ezingenayo i-nonce yesicelo kwaye kufuna ukuba i-CACTI_CSP_NONCE_ENFORCE ibe ngu-true kwi-include/config.php; ngaphandle kwelo sango licacileyo ihlala ngokukhuselekileyo kwimowudi yokunika ingxelo kuphela.  Ukungabikho (None) kukwavumela ukubizwa okungakhuselekanga kwe-eval() kwaye lolona khetho lungathinteliyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "HTMX (Default)"
msgstr "HTMX (Okungagqibekanga)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Migration (Report Only)"
msgstr "Ukufuduka kwe-Nonce (Ingxelo Kuphela)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Enforcement (Advanced)"
msgstr "Ukunyanzeliswa kwe-Nonce (Okuphambili)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "I-URI Yengxelo Yokwaphulwa kwe-CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Used in Nonce Migration and Nonce Enforcement modes.  URL where browsers post Content-Security-Policy violation reports.  Leave blank to use the bundled csp_report.php handler under the configured Cacti URL path."
msgstr "Isetyenziswa kwimowudi yoKufuduka kwe-Nonce kunye noKunyanzeliswa kwe-Nonce.  I-URL apho iibhrawuza zithumela khona iingxelo zokwaphulwa kwe-Content-Security-Policy.  Shiya kungenanto ukuze usebenzise umphathi ohlangeneyo i-csp_report.php phantsi kwendlela ye-URL ye-Cacti eqwalaselweyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Imithombo Eyenye ye-Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Space-delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can include wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Amagama edomeyini ahlulwe ngezithuba aya kuvunyelwa ukuba afikelelwe ngaphandle kweSeva yeWebhu ngokwayo.  Oku kubalulekile kubasebenzisi abakhetha ukusebenzisa i-CDN, okanye isayithi yokubamba.  Imithombo ingaquka iikhadi zasendle (wildcards) umzekelo: *.mydomain.com, okanye iprothokholi, umzekelo: https://*.example.com.  Le Mithombo Eyenye iquka iintlobo zeMifanekiso, i-CSS kunye ne-JavaScript kuphela."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable htmx for in-place filter updates"
msgstr "Vumela i-htmx kuhlaziyo lwesihluzi endaweni enye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, the htmx loader is included so pages that opt in can refresh their filter results without a full page reload. Disable only if plugins misbehave."
msgstr "Xa ivuliwe, umlayishi we-htmx uyafakwa ukuze amaphepha akhethayo akwazi ukuhlaziya iziphumo zawo zesihluzi ngaphandle kokulayisha kwakhona iphepha liphela. Khubaza kuphela ukuba iiplagi ziziphatha kakubi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On (default)"
msgstr "Ivuliwe (okungagqibekanga)"

#: include/global_settings.php support.php
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Icinyiwe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent"
msgstr "Umenzeli oKude"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using multiple Data Collectors, there are the Settings for Communicating between Data Collectors"
msgstr "Xa usebenzisa aBaqokeleli beDatha abaninzi, ezi ziiSethingi zokuNxibelelana phakathi kwaBaqokeleli beDatha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP Port"
msgstr "Izibuko le-TCP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The TCP Port used for communicating with the Remote Data Collectors.  The protocol will match the Central Cacti web server (either HTTP or HTTPS).  Leave blank to use the default ports."
msgstr "Izibuko le-TCP elisetyenziselwa ukunxibelelana naBaqokeleli beDatha abaKude.  Iprothokholi iya kuhambelana neseva yewebhu enguMbindi ye-Cacti (nokuba yi-HTTP okanye i-HTTPS).  Shiya kungenanto ukuze usebenzise amazibuko angagqibekanga."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Cacti web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Cacti Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Ixesha, ngemizuzwana, eliya kulindwa yiseva yewebhu enguMbindi ye-Cacti ukufumana impendulo kuMqokeleli weDatha oKude ukuze ifumane ulwazi olwahlukeneyo lweSixhobo phambi kokuba ishiye isicelo.  KwiZixhobo ezinxulunyaniswe naBaqokeleli beDatha abahlukileyo kuMqokeleli weDatha onguMbindi we-Cacti, uMenzeli oKude kufuneka asetyenziswe ukuqokelela ulwazi lweSixhobo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Verify Remote Agent TLS Certificates"
msgstr "Qinisekisa iziQinisekiso ze-TLS zoMenzeli oKude"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require a trusted certificate whose name matches the Remote Data Collector hostname. Disable only while replacing legacy self-signed certificates."
msgstr "Funa isiqinisekiso esithenjiweyo esigama laso lihambelana negama lomsindleki woMqokeleli weDatha oKude. Khubaza kuphela ngexesha lokutshintsha iziqinisekiso zakudala ezizisayinileyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "No (Legacy Self-signed Certificate)"
msgstr "Hayi (Isiqinisekiso Sakudala Esizisayinileyo)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent CA File"
msgstr "Ifayile ye-CA yoMenzeli oKude"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Optional absolute path to a PEM CA bundle used to verify Remote Data Collector certificates. Leave blank to use the PHP/OpenSSL system trust store."
msgstr "Indlela epheleleyo yokuzikhethela eya kwiphakheji ye-PEM CA esetyenziselwa ukuqinisekisa iziqinisekiso zoMqokeleli weDatha oKude. Shiya kungenanto ukuze usebenzise ugcino lokuthembeka lwenkqubo ye-PHP/OpenSSL."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Logging Level"
msgstr "Inqanaba lokuRekhoda"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Logging level for Automation activities.  Levels are Low, Medium and High."
msgstr "Inqanaba lokuRekhoda kwimisebenzi yoZenzekelayo.  Amanqanaba nguPhantsi, uPhakathi kunye noPhezulu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Serial Automation Scans"
msgstr "Nyanzela ukuSkenwa koZenzekelayo ngokuLandelelana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti Automation will scan one network at a time not in Parallel.  This setting can be useful when your Cacti Web Servers have limited cores for performing Automation checks."
msgstr "Xa ivuliwe, uZenzekelayo lwe-Cacti luya kuskena inethiwekhi enye ngexesha hayi ngoKunxuseneyo.  Esi sethingi sinokuba luncedo xa iiSeva zakho zeWebhu ze-Cacti zinee-cores ezilinganiselweyo zokwenza uhlolo loZenzekelayo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Vumela ukuYilwa kweeGrafu ngokuZenzekelayo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Xa ikhubaziwe, uZenzekelayo lwe-Cacti aluyi kuyila nayiphi na iGrafu ngokusebenzayo.  Oku kuluncedo xa uhlengahlengisa iisethingi zeSixhobo ukuze uphephe ukuyila iiGrafu ezintsha ngalo lonke ixesha ugcina into.  Ukubiza iMithetho yoZenzekelayo ngesandla kuya kuhlala kunokwenzeka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Vumela ukuYilwa kweeNto zoMthi ngokuZenzekelayo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Xa ikhubaziwe, uZenzekelayo lwe-Cacti aluyi kuyila nayiphi na iNto yoMthi ngokusebenzayo.  Oku kuluncedo xa uhlengahlengisa iisethingi zeSixhobo okanye zeGrafu ukuze uphephe ukuyila iiNgeniso zoMthi ezintsha ngalo lonke ixesha ugcina into.  Ukubiza iMithetho ngesandla kuya kuhlala kunokwenzeka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "I-imeyile Yomamkeli Yesaziso soZenzekelayo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the Primary Cacti Admins Email account."
msgstr "Idilesi ye-imeyile yokuthumela kuyo ii-imeyile zeSaziso soZenzekelayo ukuba ayikhankanywanga kwinqanaba leNethiwekhi yoZenzekelayo.  Ukuba eli candelo, okanye ixabiso leNethiwekhi yoZenzekelayo lishiywe lingenanto, i-Cacti iya kusebenzisa i-akhawunti ye-imeyile yabaPhathi abaPhambili be-Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Name"
msgstr "Igama Lomthumeli Lesaziso soZenzekelayo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Name to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Name."
msgstr "Igama le-imeyile elisetyenziselwa ii-imeyile zeSaziso soZenzekelayo ukuba alikhankanywanga kwinqanaba leNethiwekhi yoZenzekelayo.  Ukuba eli candelo, okanye ixabiso leNethiwekhi yoZenzekelayo lishiywe lingenanto, i-Cacti iya kusebenzisa iGama Lomthumeli elingagqibekanga lenkqubo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Email"
msgstr "I-imeyile Yomthumeli Yesaziso soZenzekelayo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Email Address."
msgstr "Idilesi Ye-imeyile emayisetyenziselwe Ii-imeyile Zesaziso Sokuzenzekela ukuba ayichazwanga kwinqanaba Lenethiwekhi Yokuzenzekela. Ukuba eli candelo, okanye ixabiso Lenethiwekhi Yokuzenzekela lishiywe lingenanto, i-Cacti iya kusebenzisa Idilesi Ye-imeyile Yomthumeli emiselweyo yesistim."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Defaults"
msgstr "Okumiselweyo Kwethempleyithi Yegrafu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Test Data Source"
msgstr "Umthombo Wedatha Wovavanyo Lwethempleyithi Yegrafu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation for new and newly imported Graph Templates.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Beka uphawu kule bhokisi yokukhetha ukuba ufuna ukuvavanya Imithombo Yedatha phambi kokuyidalwa kwazo kwiiThempleyithi Zegrafu ezintsha nezisandula ukungeniswa. Xa Uvavanyo Lwemithombo Yedatha luvuliwe, ukuba Umthombo Wedatha awubuyiseli datha isebenzayo, Igrafu ayiyi kuyilwa. Esi setingi sibalulekile ukuba ufuna ukuba neThempleyithi Yesixhobo eqhelekileyo engabandakanya Iithempleyithi Zegrafu ezingaphezulu ezinokusetyenziswa ngokukhetha ngokuxhomekeke kwiimpawu zeSixhobo ngokwaso. Qaphela: Ukuba unesikripthi esithatha ixesha elide njengoMthombo Wedatha, ixesha lokuyila Iigrafu liya kwanda."

#: include/global_settings.php
