msgstr "Iphothi ye-UDP emiselweyo yazo zonke Izixhobo ezintsha. Ngokuqhelekileyo yi-161."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default SNMP timeout in milli-seconds for all new Devices."
msgstr "Ixesha lokuphelelwa lwe-SNMP elimiselweyo ngeemilisekondi lazo zonke Izixhobo ezintsha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "must be a positive integer (milliseconds)."
msgstr "kufuneka ibe linani elipheleleyo eliphosithivu (eemilisekondi)."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "must be between {{ min }} and {{ max }}."
msgstr "kufuneka ibe phakathi kuka-{{ min }} no-{{ max }}."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default SNMP retries for all new Devices."
msgstr "Iinzame zokuphinda ze-SNMP ezimiselweyo zazo zonke Izixhobo ezintsha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "must be a non-negative integer."
msgstr "kufuneka ibe linani elipheleleyo elingekho ngaphantsi kukaziro."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Behavior"
msgstr "Ukuziphatha kwe-SNMP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Agent Support Enabled"
msgstr "Inkxaso Ye-arhente ye-SNMP Ivuliwe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this option is checked, Cacti will populate SNMP Agent tables with Cacti device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "Ukuba olu khetho lukhethiwe, i-Cacti iya kuzalisa iitheyibhile ze-Arhente ye-SNMP ngolwazi lwesixhobo nolwesistim lwe-Cacti. Ayivuli I-arhente ye-SNMP ngokwayo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable MD5 and DES for SNMPv3"
msgstr "Vula i-MD5 ne-DES kwi-SNMPv3"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The MD5 authentication and DES privacy algorithms are legacy, weak, and unavailable on hardened (FIPS) PHP and Net-SNMP builds.  When disabled, MD5 and DES are removed from the SNMPv3 Authentication and Privacy Protocol dropdowns shown when editing a Device and in the Automation SNMP Options, leaving only the stronger SHA and AES algorithms."
msgstr "Ii-algorithms zoqinisekiso ze-MD5 nezabucala ze-DES zezakudala, zibuthathaka, kwaye azifumaneki kwii-builds ze-PHP ne-Net-SNMP eziqinisiweyo (FIPS). Xa zivaliwe, i-MD5 ne-DES ziyasuswa kuluhlu olwehlayo lweProthokholi Yoqinisekiso neYabucala ye-SNMPv3 oluboniswa xa kuhlelwa Isixhobo nakwiinketho ze-SNMP Zokuzenzekela, kushiywa kuphela ii-algorithms ezomeleleyo ze-SHA ne-AES."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Credential Cache"
msgstr "Vula I-cache Yeziqinisekiso"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pre-harden and cache SNMPv3 credential arguments once per credential change so each poller process reuses them instead of rebuilding them on every request.  This yields a marginal savings when collecting with SNMPv3 credentials through the Net-SNMP binaries.  The php-snmp extension handles most SNMPv3 gets in-process and bypasses this cache, but the Net-SNMP binaries (and therefore this cache) are still used for SNMP walks, hex output, requests that set a context or engine id, and protocol combinations that the running PHP version does not support.  Enable this if you collect any of those workloads with SNMPv3 credentials."
msgstr "Qinisa kwangaphambili uze ugcine kwi-cache iipharamitha zeziqinisekiso ze-SNMPv3 kube kanye kutshintsho ngalunye lwesiqinisekiso ukuze inkqubo nganye ye-poller iphinde izisebenzise endaweni yokuzakha kwakhona kwisicelo ngasinye. Oku kunika ukonga okuncinci xa kuqokelelwa ngeziqinisekiso ze-SNMPv3 ngee-binary ze-Net-SNMP. I-extension ye-php-snmp iphatha uninzi lwezicelo ze-get ze-SNMPv3 ngaphakathi kwenkqubo kwaye iyayitsiba le cache, kodwa ii-binary ze-Net-SNMP (ngoko ke nale cache) zisasetyenziselwa ii-SNMP walk, iziphumo ze-hex, izicelo ezimisela umxholo okanye i-engine id, kunye nemidibaniso yeeprothokholi engaxhaswayo luguqulelo lwe-PHP olusebenzayo. Vula oku ukuba uqokelela nayiphi na kule misebenzi ngeziqinisekiso ze-SNMPv3."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max OID Limit"
msgstr "Umda Ophezulu we-OID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Cacti's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Inani eliphezulu elimiselweyo lee-OID ze-SNMP Get ezikhutshwayo ngesicelo ngasinye se-snmpget. Kwizixhobo, esi setingi silawulwa kwinqanaba leSixhobo. Kufuneka usebenzise esi setingi kuphela xa usebenzisa i-SNMP API ye-Cacti ngokwendalo kwizikripthi okanye kwii-plugin zakho."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "Ubungakanani Bokulanda be-Bulkwalk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How many OID's should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "Zingaphi ii-OID ezifanele ukubuyiswa kwisicelo ngasinye se-snmpbulkwalk? Kwizixhobo ezinemithi emikhulu ye-SNMP, ukwandisa obu bukhulu kuya kwandisa ukusebenza kokuhlaziya i-index kwi-WAN."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable increasing OID Check"
msgstr "Khubaza uKujonga ukwanda kwe-OID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls disabling check for increasing OID while walking OID tree."
msgstr "Ilawula ukukhubaza ukujongwa kokwanda kwe-OID ngexesha lokuhamba kumthi we-OID."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Availability/Reachability"
msgstr "Ukufumaneka/Ukufikeleleka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Availability/Reachability for all new Devices.  The method Cacti will use to determine if a Device is available for polling.  <br><i>NOTE: It is recommended that, at a minimum, SNMP always be selected.</i>"
msgstr "Ukufumaneka/Ukufikeleleka okuMiselweyo kuzo zonke iziXhobo ezitsha. Indlela i-Cacti eya kuyisebenzisa ukumisela ukuba iSixhobo siyafumaneka na ukuze sivavanywe. <br><i>QAPHELA: Kuyacetyiswa ukuba, ubuncinci, i-SNMP ihlale ikhethiwe.</i>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Downed Device SNMP Recovery Options Retry Frequency"
msgstr "Ukuphindaphindwa kokuzama kwiiNketho zokuBuyisela ze-SNMP zeSixhobo eSiwileyo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When a Device is Down, and has an SNMP Recovery Options Set established, how often do you wish to try to retry the Device using the SNMP Options Set specified?"
msgstr "Xa iSixhobo siWile, kwaye simiselwe iSeti yeeNketho zokuBuyisela ze-SNMP, ufuna ukuzama kangaphi ukuphinda uzame iSixhobo usebenzisa iSeti yeeNketho ze-SNMP echaziweyo?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping Type"
msgstr "Uhlobo lwe-Ping"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping type for all new Devices.</i>"
msgstr "Uhlobo lwe-Ping oluMiselweyo kuzo zonke iziXhobo ezitsha.</i>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping Port for all new Devices.  With TCP, Cacti will attempt to Syn the port.  With UDP, Cacti requires either a successful connection, or a 'port not reachable' error to determine if the Device is up or not."
msgstr "IsiBuko se-Ping esiMiselweyo kuzo zonke iziXhobo ezitsha. Nge-TCP, i-Cacti iya kuzama ukwenza i-Syn kwisibuko. Nge-UDP, i-Cacti ifuna uqhagamshelwano oluyimpumelelo, okanye impazamo ethi 'isibuko asifikeleleki' ukumisela ukuba iSixhobo siyasebenza okanye akunjalo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping Timeout value in milli-seconds for all new Devices.  The timeout values to use for Device SNMP, ICMP, UDP and TCP pinging.  ICMP Pings will be rounded up to the nearest second.  TCP and UDP connection timeouts on Windows are controlled by the operating system, and are therefore not recommended on Windows."
msgstr "Ixabiso eliMiselweyo lokuPhelelwa liXesha le-Ping ngee-milliseconds kuzo zonke iziXhobo ezitsha. Amaxabiso okuphelelwa lixesha okusetyenziselwa ukwenza i-ping ye-SNMP, i-ICMP, i-UDP kunye ne-TCP yeSixhobo. Ii-Ping ze-ICMP ziya kurawundelwa kumzuzwana okufuphi ophezulu. Ukuphelelwa lixesha koqhagamshelwano lwe-TCP kunye ne-UDP kwi-Windows kulawulwa yinkqubo yokusebenza, kwaye ke ngoko akukhuthazwa kwi-Windows."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of times Cacti will attempt to ping a Device before marking it as down."
msgstr "Inani lamaxesha i-Cacti eya kuzama ukwenza i-ping kwiSixhobo phambi kokuba isiphawule njengesiwileyo."

