msgstr "Uhlobo lwe-poller oluza kusetyenziswa.  Olu seto luya kusebenza kwisithuba esilandelayo se-polling."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
msgstr "Isithuba se-polling esisetyenziswayo.  Olu seto luya kuchaphazela ukuba ii-RRDfiles zihlolwa kwaye zihlaziywa kangaphi.  <strong><u>QAPHELA: Ukuba utshintsha eli xabiso, kufuneka uphinde ugcwalise i-poller cache.  Ukungaphumeleli ukwenza oko, kunokukhokelela ekulahlekeni kwedatha.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "is not a valid choice."
msgstr "ayilokhetho oluchanekileyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
msgstr "Isithuba se-Cron/Daemon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Cacti data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Cacti data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Ukufuthi okuya kuqaliswa ngako umqokeleli wedatha we-Cacti.  Ungasebenzisa nokuba yi-crontab, umsebenzi ocwangcisiweyo (kwi-windows), okanye inkonzo ye-systemd ye-cactid ukulawula ukuqaliswa komqokeleli wedatha we-Cacti.  Ngemiyalelo yokusebenzisa i-daemon ye-cactid, jonga ifayile ye-README.md kuvimba wenkonzo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Linganisa uMthwalo weNkqubo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "Ukuba ukhetha olu khetho, i-Cacti iya kuzama ukulinganisa umthwalo wenkqubo nganye ye-poller ngokwaba ngokulinganayo imiba ye-poller kwinkqubo nganye."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Ububanzi beMveliso ye-Debug"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will check for output that exceeds Cacti's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "Ukuba ukhetha olu khetho, i-Cacti iya kukhangela imveliso edlula amandla e-Cacti okuyigcina kwaye ikhuphe isilumkiso xa iyifumana."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Ixesha lokuPhelelwa le-Arhente eKude"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Refresh Poller Table Per Cycle"
msgstr "Hlaziya iTheyibhile ye-Poller ngoMjikelo ngaMnye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Olu seto lwenzelwe iinkqubo ze-poller enye kuphela ukuze kwakhiwe kwakhona itheyibhile yemveliso ye-poller kumjikelo ngamnye we-polling ukunqanda itheyibhile yememori ekusebenziseni i-swap kwiinkqubo ezinkulu kakhulu ezineedatabase ezinkulu ezinokusebenzisa i-swap."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Replication"
msgstr "Uphindaphindo loMqokeleli weDatha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Sync Interval"
msgstr "Isithuba soNgqamaniso lwe-Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Isithuba esisisiseko songqamaniso lwe-polling esiza kusetyenziswa xa kusenziwa i-poller.  Olu seto luya kuchaphazela ukuba ii-poller ezikude zihlolwa kwaye zihlaziywa kangaphi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Khubaza uPhindaphindo lwe-Resource Cache"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Cacti Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Cacti Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Ngokungagqibekanga, Umqokeleli Wedatha oyintloko we-Cacti uya kugcina yonke iwebhusayithi kunye neeplagini kwi-Resource Cache. Emva koko, ngamaxesha athile Abaqokeleli Bedatha Abakude baya kuzihlaziya ngalo naluphi na uhlaziyo oluvela kuMqokeleli Wedatha oyintloko we-Cacti. Le Resource Cache ivumela Abaqokeleli Bedatha Abakude ukuba baziphucule ngokwabo. Ukuba awufuni ukusebenzisa olu khetho, ungalukhubaza usebenzisa le setingi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Automatic Full Sync on Upgrade"
msgstr "Khubaza Ungqamaniso Olupheleleyo Oluzenzekelayo Xa Kuphuculwa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, upon upgrading the Main Cacti system, it will perform a Full Sync to all Data Collectors.  This process may be time consuming.  Therefore, to allow upgrades to be completed quicker, we provide this option.  Note that if this is disabled, the Cacti administrator must force this process from the Data Collectors interface after upgrade."
msgstr "Ngokungagqibekanga, xa kuphuculwa isistim eyintloko ye-Cacti, iya kwenza Ungqamaniso Olupheleleyo kubo bonke Abaqokeleli Bedatha. Le nkqubo inokuthatha ixesha elide. Ngoko ke, ukuze iziphuculo zigqitywe ngokukhawuleza, sinikezela ngolu khetho. Qaphela ukuba ukuba oku kukhubaziwe, umlawuli we-Cacti kufuneka anyanzele le nkqubo kwijongano Labaqokeleli Bedatha emva kokuphucula."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Iisetingi Ezongezelelweyo Zomqokeleli Wedatha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Ukurekhodwa Kwedatha Engamkelekanga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Ungathanda ukuba iimpazamo zesiphumo soMqokeleli Wedatha zirekhodwe njani? Iinketho ziquka: 'Okuneenkcukacha' okuchaza impazamo nganye ngokweenkcukacha, 'Isishwankathelo' esinika inani leempazamo zesiphumo ngeSixhobo ngasinye, kunye 'Akukho nanye', engeniki manani eempazamo."

