msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Isishwankathelo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Okuneenkcukacha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "Inani Leeseva Zezikripthi Ze-PHP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Inani leenkqubo zeseva yezikripthi ezisebenza ngaxeshanye kwinkqubo nganye ye-spine. Iisetingi eziphakathi kwe-1 ne-15 zamkelekile. Le pharamitha iya kunceda ukuba usebenzisa imitya emininzi kunye nezikripthi zeseva yezikripthi kwaye isebenza kuphela kuMqokeleli Wedatha we-spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Ixabiso Lomda Wexesha Lesikripthi Neseva Yesikripthi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and valid for both cmd.php and spine Data Collectors."
msgstr "Elona xesha lide i-spine eya kulilinda ukuze iskripthi sigqitywe. Eli xabiso lomda wexesha likwimizuzwana kwaye lisebenza kuzo zombini i-cmd.php kunye nabaqokeleli bedatha be-spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Output Not Empty Debouncing"
msgstr "Ukudambisa Ukuphindaphindeka Kwe-Poller Output Not Empty"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you are having issues with some data sources, your Email could be flooded with 'Poller Output Not Empty' warnings.  If this is happening, you can debounce the setting based upon this interval."
msgstr "Ukuba uneengxaki ngeminye imithombo yedatha, i-imeyile yakho inokuzaliswa zizilumkiso ezithi 'Poller Output Not Empty'. Ukuba oku kuyenzeka, unokudambisa le setingi ngokusekelwe kwesi sithuba sexesha."

