msgstr "Umda Wesilumkiso Senani Leyure Enye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When the Poller Guarded Ratio (below) is reached breached more than this many times in an hour, a warning will be written to the Cacti log and an Email will be sent to the Primary Cact Administraror notifying them of the Poller runtime deviation."
msgstr "Xa i-Poller Guarded Ratio (engezantsi) idlulwa ngaphezu kweli nani lamaxesha ngeyure enye, isilumkiso siya kubhalwa kwilogi ye-Cacti kwaye i-imeyile iya kuthunyelwa kuMlawuli Oyintloko we-Cacti emazisa ngokuphambuka kwexesha lokusebenza kwe-Poller."

