#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Background Commands script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed.  This script will perform tasks such as re-indexing Devices and pruning devices from Remote Data Collectors."
msgstr "Elona xesha lide iskripthi se-Background Commands se-Cacti sinokusebenza ngalo ngaphandle kokuvelisa impazamo yokuphela kwexesha kwaye sipheliswe. Esi skripthi siya kwenza imisebenzi efana nokwenza i-indeksi kwakhona kweZixhobo nokucoca izixhobo kubaqokeleli bedatha abakude."

#: include/global_settings.php
