msgstr "Elona xesha lide iskripthi se-Spikekill se-Cacti sinokusebenza ngalo ngaphandle kokuvelisa impazamo yokuphela kwexesha kwaye sipheliswe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "Indlela Yoqinisekiso"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Cacti handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Cacti.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against a LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHPs LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Cacti resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Uqinisekiso lwaNgaphakathi</i> - I-Cacti ilawula uqinisekiso lwabasebenzisi, nto leyo ekuvumela ukuba wenze abasebenzisi kwaye ubanike amalungelo kwiindawo ezahlukeneyo ngaphakathi kwe-Cacti.<br><br><i>Uqinisekiso oluSisiseko lweWebhu</i> - Uqinisekiso lulawulwa yiseva yewebhu. Abasebenzisi bangongezwa okanye benziwe ngokuzenzekelayo xa bengena okokuqala ukuba Umsebenzisi weTempleyithi uchaziwe, kungenjalo kuya kusetyenziswa iimvume zendwendwe ezichaziweyo.<br><br><i>Uqinisekiso lwe-LDAP</i> - Luvumela uqinisekiso ngeseva ye-LDAP. Abasebenzisi baya kwenziwa ngokuzenzekelayo xa bengena okokuqala ukuba Umsebenzisi weTempleyithi uchaziwe, kungenjalo kuya kusetyenziswa iimvume zendwendwe ezichaziweyo.  Ukuba imodyuli ye-LDAP ye-PHP ayivulwanga, Uqinisekiso lwe-LDAP aluyi kuvela njengokhetho olunokukhethwa.<br><br><i>Uqinisekiso lweDomeyini eNinzi ye-LDAP/AD</i> - Luvumela abalawuli ukuba baxhase amaqela amaninzi ahlukahlukeneyo asuka kwiinkomba ze-LDAP/AD ezahlukeneyo ukuze afikelele kwizibonelelo ze-Cacti.  Kanye njengoQinisekiso lwe-LDAP, imodyuli ye-LDAP ye-PHP iyafuneka ukuze kusetyenziswe le ndlela.</blockquote>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Support Authentication Cookies"
msgstr "Xhasa iiKhukhi zoQinisekiso"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use.  Note, the client must use HTTPS to leverage this feature."
msgstr "Ukuba umsebenzisi uyaqinisekisa aze akhethe u-'Ndigcine ndingene', ikhukhi yoqinisekiso iya kwenziwa kwikhompyutha yomsebenzisi evumela loo msebenzisi ukuba ahlale engenile.  Ikhukhi yoqinisekiso iphelelwa lixesha emva kweentsuku ezingama-90 zokungasetyenziswa.  Qaphela, iklayenti kufuneka isebenzise i-HTTPS ukuze isebenzise olu phawu."

