msgstr "Inani leenkqubo ze-Boost ezisebenza ngaxeshanye zokucubungula zonke ii-RRD ezikwitafile ye-Boost."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Ubuninzi beeRekhodi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "Ukuba itafile yemveliso ye-Boost idlula kobu bungakanani, ngokweerekhodi, uhlaziyo luya kwenzeka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Data Source Items Per Pass"
msgstr "Ubuninzi beZinto zoMthombo weDatha ngokuDlula ngakunye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "To optimize performance, the boost RRD updater needs to know how many Data Source Items should be retrieved in one pass.  Please be careful not to set too high as graphing performance during major updates can be compromised.  If you encounter graphing or polling slowness during updates, lower this number.  The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Ukuze kuphuculwe ukusebenza, isihlaziyi se-RRD se-Boost sifuna ukwazi ukuba zingaphi iZinto zoMthombo weDatha ezifanele ukufunyanwa kudlulo olunye. Nceda ulumke ungamiseli phezulu kakhulu kuba ukusebenza kweegrafu ngexesha lohlaziyo olukhulu kunokuchaphazeleka. Ukuba uhlangabezana nokucotha kweegrafu okanye kwe-polling ngexesha lohlaziyo, yehlisa eli nani. Ixabiso elimiselweyo ngu-50000."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Ubude obuphezulu be-Argument"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating systems Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Xa i-Boost ithumela imiyalelo yohlaziyo kwi-RRDtool, akufuneki idlule kuBude obuphezulu be-Argument benkqubo yokusebenza. Oku kuyahluka ngokwenkqubo yokusebenza kunye nenqanaba le-kernel. Umzekelo: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ ayinasiphelo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Boost and Poller"
msgstr "Umda weMemori ye-Boost kunye ne-Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
