msgstr "Ukuba imiselwe, i-Boost iya kuloga iinkcukacha zokulungisa iimpazamo ngokuthe ngqo kwifayile yelogi ye-Boost. Nceda uqaphele, ukuyivumela kunokubangela izinga eliphezulu le-I/O kwinkqubo yeefayile yendawo."

