msgstr "IiNkcukacha-manani zoMthombo weDatha zinokusebenzisa indlela endala apho ziya kumisela amaxabiso aphezulu naqhelekileyo, okanye imo ephambili eya kubala amaxabiso amaninzi ongezelelweyo eenkcukacha-manani ukongeza kwincopho nakwi-avareji. Ukusebenzisa Zonke iiMetrikhi zeeNkcukacha-manani kunokubeka umthwalo owongezelelweyo we-CPU kunye ne-IO kwinkqubo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Peak/Average Only"
msgstr "Incopho/I-avareji Kuphela"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "All Statistical Metrics"
msgstr "Zonke iiMetrikhi zeeNkcukacha-manani"

#: include/global_settings.php
