msgstr "Olu khetho luya kuphindaphinda kabini ixesha lokuqokelelwa kwedatha. Luya kusebenzisa umsebenzi wokudibanisa we-MAX kwaye lubale iinkcukacha-manani ukusuka kumaxabiso aphezulu kuluhlu lwexesha ngalunye olufanelekileyo."

