msgstr "Khangela olu seto ukuze ugcine itafile yedatha yosuku ngalunye, iveki, inyanga, kunye nonyaka. Amaxesha okudalwa kwezi tafile aya kusekelwa kule fomula ilandelayo: Yemihla ngemihla - Ulwahlulo olunye ngosuku, Yeveki - Ulwahlulo olunye ngeVeki, Yenyanga - Ulwahlulo olunye ngeNyanga, Yonyaka - Ulwahlulo olunye ngoNyaka. Zonke iitafile ziya kuba nezi zimamva zilandelayo ngokohlobo: Yemihla ngemihla: YYYYDDD, Yeveki: YYYYWW, Yenyanga: YYYYMM, kunye neYonyaka: izimamva zika-YYYY."

