#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the backup proxy is using. This required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Ushicilelo lomnwe lwesitshixo sikawonke-wonke se-RSA esisetyenziswa yi-proxy yogcino ngoku. Oku kufuneka ukuseka uqhagamshelwano oluthembekileyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Useto Lokuphelisa Iincopho"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Removal Method"
msgstr "Indlela Yokususa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples."
msgstr "Kukho iindlela ezimbini zokususa. Eyokuqala, Ukuphambuka Okuqhelekileyo, iya kususa nayiphi na isampulu ekude ngenani elingu-X lokuphambuka okuqhelekileyo ukusuka kumyinge weesampulu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Standard Deviation"
msgstr "Ukuphambuka Okuqhelekileyo"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Replacement Method"
msgstr "Indlela Yokutshintsha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "Kukho iindlela ezintathu zokutshintsha.  Indlela yokuqala itshintsha i-spike ngomndilili womthombo wedatha ochaphazelekayo.  Indlela yesibini itshintsha i-spike nge-'NaN'.  Eyokugqibela itshintsha i-spike ngexabiso lokugqibela elifunyenweyo elilungileyo."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Average"
msgstr "Umndilili"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "NaN's"
msgstr "Ii-NaN"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Last Known Good"
msgstr "Elokugqibela Elilungileyo Elaziwayo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Standard Deviations"
msgstr "Inani Leziphambuko Ezisemgangathweni"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Any value that is this many standard deviations above the average will be excluded.  A good number will be dependent on the type of data to be operated on.  We recommend a number no lower than 5 Standard Deviations."
msgstr "Naliphi na ixabiso elingaphezulu komndilili ngala manani eziphambuko ezisemgangathweni liya kukhutshwa.  Inani elilungileyo liya kuxhomekeka kuhlobo lwedatha ekusetyenzwa ngayo.  Sicebisa inani elingekho ngaphantsi kweZiphambuko Ezisemgangathweni ezi-5."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Standard Deviations"
msgstr "%d Iziphambuko Ezisemgangathweni"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max Kills Per RRA"
msgstr "Elona Nani Likhulu Lokususwa Kwi-RRA Nganye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the maximum number of spikes to remove from a Graph RRA."
msgstr "Eli xabiso limele elona nani likhulu lee-spike ekufuneka zisuswe kwi-RRA Yegrafu."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Spikes"
msgstr "%d Ii-spike"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Absolute Maximum Value"
msgstr "Elona Xabiso Likhulu Ngokupheleleyo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the maximum raw value of any data point to remove from a Graph RRA."
msgstr "Eli xabiso limele elona xabiso likhulu elingasetyenzwanga layo nayiphi na indawo yedatha ekufuneka isuswe kwi-RRA Yegrafu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Thousand"
