#: index.php
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Cacti Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use the Cacti's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collectors Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Cacti Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump it's Boost table output back to the Main Cacti Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>QAPHELA:</strong> Ungene kuMqokeleli Weenkcukacha Okude.  Xa <b>'ikunxibelelwano'</b>, uya kukwazi ukujonga nokulawula inxalenye enkulu yeWebhusayithi ePhambili ye-Cacti kanye ngokungathi ungene kuyo.  Kwakhona, kubalulekile ukuqaphela ukuba AbaQokeleli Beenkcukacha Abakude bayafuneka ukuze basebenzise umsebenzi weeNkonzo Zokonyusa Ukusebenza kwe-Cacti <b>'Uhlaziyo Ngokufunwa'</b>, kwaye sihlala sicebisa ukusebenzisa i-Spine.  Xa uMqokeleli Weenkcukacha Okude <b>'engaphandle konxibelelwano'</b>, iWebhusayithi yoMqokeleli Weenkcukacha Okude iya kuba neenkcukacha ezimbalwa kakhulu.  Nangona kunjalo, iya kugcinela okwexeshana lonke uhlaziyo de iSiseko Seenkcukacha eSiphambili se-Cacti kunye neSeva yeWebhu zifikeleleke.  Emva koko iya kuthumela isiphumo sayo setheyibhile ye-Boost sibuyele kwiSiseko Seenkcukacha eSiphambili se-Cacti ukuze sihlaziywe."

#: index.php
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Cacti Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>QAPHELA:</strong> Akukho nanye kwiiPlagini eziSisiseko ze-Cacti, ukuza kuthi ga ngoku, ethe yayilwa ngokutsha ukuze isebenze nabaQokeleli Beenkcukacha Abakude.  Ngoko ke, iiPlagini ezifana ne-MacTrack, kunye ne-HMIB, ezifuna ukufikelela ngokuthe ngqo kwizixhobo aziyi kusebenza nabaQokeleli Beenkcukacha Abakude ngeli xesha.  Nangona kunjalo, iiplagini ezifana ne-Thold ziya kusebenza logama nje uMqokeleli Weenkcukacha Okude ekwimowudi <b>'ekunxibelelwano'</b>."

