#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The following PHP extensions are recommended, and should be installed before continuing your Cacti install.  NOTE: If you are planning on supporting SNMPv3 with IPv6 or SNMPv3 with stronger ciphers, you should not install the php-snmp module at this time."
msgstr "Ezi zandiso ze-PHP zilandelayo ziyacetyiswa, kwaye kufuneka zifakwe ngaphambi kokuba uqhubeke nofakelo lwakho lwe-Cacti.  QAPHELA: Ukuba uceba ukuxhasa i-SNMPv3 nge-IPv6 okanye i-SNMPv3 enezimfihlo eziqinileyo, akufunekanga ufake imodyuli ye-php-snmp ngeli xesha."

#: lib/installer.php
