msgstr "Nyusela ukusuka kwi-<strong>%1$s</strong> ukuya kwi-<strong>%2$s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "In the event of issues, It is highly recommended that you clear your browser cache, closing then reopening your browser (not just the tab Cacti is on) and retrying, before raising an issue with The Cacti Group"
msgstr "Kwimeko yeengxaki, kucetyiswa kakhulu ukuba ucoce i-cache yebhrawuza yakho, uvale uze uvule kwakhona ibhrawuza yakho (hayi nje ithebhu ekuyo i-Cacti) uze uzame kwakhona, ngaphambi kokuba uphakamise ingxaki kwi-The Cacti Group"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "On rare occasions, we have had reports from users who experience some minor issues due to changes in the code.  These issues are caused by the browser retaining pre-upgrade code and whilst we have taken steps to minimise the chances of this, it may still occur.  If you need instructions on how to clear your browser cache, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> is a good starting point."
msgstr "Kwiimeko ezinqabileyo, sikhe safumana iingxelo kubasebenzisi abafumana iingxaki ezincinci ngenxa yotshintsho kwikhowudi.  Ezi ngxaki zibangelwa yibhrawuza egcina ikhowudi yangaphambi konyuselo kwaye nangona sithathe amanyathelo okunciphisa amathuba oku, kusenokwenzeka.  Ukuba ufuna imiyalelo yendlela yokucoca i-cache yebhrawuza yakho, i-<a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> sisiqalo esihle."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If after clearing your cache and restarting your browser, you still experience issues, please raise the issue with us and we will try to identify the cause of it."
msgstr "Ukuba emva kokucoca i-cache yakho nokuqalisa kwakhona ibhrawuza yakho, usafumana iingxaki, nceda uphakamise ingxaki kuthi kwaye siya kuzama ukuchonga unobangela wayo."

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Downgrade from <strong>%s</strong> to <strong>%s</strong>"
msgstr "Yehlisa ukusuka kwi-<strong>%1$s</strong> ukuya kwi-<strong>%2$s</strong>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "You appear to be downgrading to a previous version.  Database changes made for the newer version will not be reversed and <i>could</i> cause issues."
msgstr "Ubonakala ngathi wehlisela kuguqulelo lwangaphambili.  Utshintsho lwedathabheyisi olwenzelwe uguqulelo olutsha aluyi kubuyiselwa umva kwaye <i>lunokubangela</i> iingxaki."

