#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Configuration Readonly!"
msgstr "Uqwalaselo Lufundwa Kuphela!"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your config.php file must be writable by the web server during install in order to configure the Remote poller.  Once installation is complete, you must set this file to Read Only to prevent possible security issues."
msgstr "Ifayile yakho ye-config.php kufuneka ibhaleke yiseva yewebhu ngexesha lofakelo ukuze iqwalasele i-poller eKude.  Nje ukuba ufakelo lugqitywe, kufuneka usete le fayile ibe yi-Funda Kuphela ukuthintela iingxaki zokhuseleko ezinokubakho."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Configuration of Poller"
msgstr "Uqwalaselo lwe-Poller"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Remote Cacti Poller information has not been included in your config.php file.  Please review the config.php.dist, and set the variables: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, etc.  These variables must be set and point back to your Primary Cacti database server.  Correct this and try again."
msgstr "Ulwazi lwakho lwe-Remote Cacti Poller alufakwanga kwifayile yakho ye-config.php.  Nceda uphonononge i-config.php.dist, kwaye usete izinto eziguquguqukayo: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, njl.njl.  Ezi zinto ziguquguqukayo kufuneka zisetwe kwaye zikhombe emva kwiseva yakho yedathabheyisi ye-Cacti ePhambili.  Lungisa oku uze uzame kwakhona."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Remote Poller Variables"
msgstr "Izinto Eziguquguqukayo Ze-Poller eKude"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The variables that must be set in the config.php file include the following:"
msgstr "Izinto eziguquguqukayo ezifanele ukusetwa kwifayile ye-config.php ziquka ezi zilandelayo:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The Installer automatically assigns a $poller_id and adds it to the config.php file."
msgstr "Umfakeli wabela ngokuzenzekelayo i-$poller_id aze ayongeze kwifayile ye-config.php."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Once the variables are all set in the config.php file, you must also grant the $rdatabase_username access to the main Cacti database server.  Follow the same procedure you would with any other Cacti install.  You may then press the 'Test Connection' button.  If the test is successful you will be able to proceed and complete the install."
msgstr "Emva kokuba zonke iivariyabuli zisetwe kwifayile ye-config.php, kufuneka kwakhona unike u-$rdatabase_username ufikelelo kwiseva yedathabheyisi ephambili ye-Cacti. Landela inkqubo efanayo obuya kuyilandela nakuluphi na olunye ufakelo lwe-Cacti. Emva koko ungacofa iqhosha elithi 'Vavanya uQhagamshelwano'. Ukuba uvavanyo luphumelele uya kukwazi ukuqhubeka kwaye ugqibezele ufakelo."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Additional Steps After Installation"
msgstr "Amanyathelo oNgezelelweyo Emva koFakelo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is essential that the Central Cacti server can communicate via MySQL to each remote Cacti database server.  Once the install is complete, you must edit the Remote Data Collector and ensure the settings are correct.  You can verify using the 'Test Connection' when editing the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Kubalulekile ukuba iseva ePhakathi ye-Cacti ikwazi ukunxibelelana nge-MySQL neseva nganye yedathabheyisi ye-Cacti ekude. Emva kokuba ufakelo lugqityiwe, kufuneka uhlele uMqokeleli weDatha oKude kwaye uqinisekise ukuba iisetingi zichanekile. Ungaqinisekisa ngokusebenzisa u-'Vavanya uQhagamshelwano' xa uhlela uMqokeleli weDatha oKude."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Critical Binary Locations and Versions"
msgstr "Iindawo zee-Binary eziBalulekileyo kunye neeNguqulelo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Make sure all of these values are correct before continuing."
msgstr "Qinisekisa ukuba onke la maxabiso achanekile phambi kokuba uqhubeke."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "One or more paths appear to be incorrect, unable to proceed"
msgstr "Indlela enye okanye ezininzi zibonakala zingachanekanga, akukwazi kuqhubeka"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Directory Permission Checks"
msgstr "Ukuhlolwa kweeMvume zoVimba beeFayile"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please ensure the directory permissions below are correct before proceeding.  During the install, these directories need to be owned by the Web Server user.  These permission changes are required to allow the Installer to install Device Template packages which include XML and script files that will be placed in these directories.  If you choose not to install the packages, there is an 'install_package.php' cli script that can be used from the command line after the install is complete."
msgstr "Nceda uqinisekise ukuba iimvume zovimba beefayile ezingezantsi zichanekile phambi kokuba uqhubeke. Ngexesha lofakelo, aba vimba beefayile kufuneka babe ngabomsebenzisi weSeva yeWebhu. Olu tshintsho lweemvume luyafuneka ukuze uMfakeli afake iipakethe zeeThempleyithi zeSixhobo ezibandakanya iifayile ze-XML kunye neze-script eziza kubekwa kuba vimba beefayile. Ukuba ukhetha ukungazifaki iipakethe, kukho i-cli script ethi 'install_package.php' enokusetyenziswa kumgca womyalelo emva kokuba ufakelo lugqityiwe."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "After the install is complete, you can make some of these directories read only to increase security."
msgstr "Emva kokuba ufakelo lugqityiwe, ungenza abanye baba vimba beefayile bafundwe kuphela ukuze wandise ukhuseleko."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These directories will be required to stay read writable after the install so that the Cacti remote synchronization process can update them as the Main Cacti Web Site changes"
msgstr "Aba vimba beefayile kuya kufuneka bahlale befundeka kwaye bebhalwa emva kofakelo ukuze inkqubo yongqamaniso olukude lwe-Cacti ikwazi ukubahlaziya njengoko iWebhusayithi ePhambili ye-Cacti itshintsha"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If you are installing packages, once the packages are installed, you should change the scripts directory back to read only as this presents some exposure to the web site."
msgstr "Ukuba ufaka iipakethe, xa iipakethe sezifakiwe, kufuneka utshintshe uvimba weefayile wee-scripts abuyele ekufundweni kuphela njengoko oku kubangela umngcipheko othile kwiwebhusayithi."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "For remote pollers, it is critical that the paths that you will be updating frequently, including the plugins, scripts, and resources paths have read/write access as the data collector will have to update these paths from the main web server content."
msgstr "Kwii-pollers ezikude, kubalulekile ukuba iindlela oza kuzihlaziya rhoqo, kubandakanya iindlela ze-plugins, ii-scripts, kunye ne-resources zibe nofikelelo lokufunda/ukubhala njengoko umqokeleli wedatha kuya kufuneka ahlaziye ezi ndlela kwisiqulatho seseva yewebhu ephambili."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Required Writable at Install Time Only"
msgstr "Kufuneka iBhaleke ngeXesha loFakelo Kuphela"

#: lib/installer.php package_import.php
msgid "Not Writable"
msgstr "Ayibhaleki"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Required Writable after Install Complete"
msgstr "Kufuneka iBhaleke emva kokuGqitywa koFakelo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Potential permission issues"
msgstr "Iingxaki ezinokubakho ngeemvume"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please make sure that your webserver has read/write access to the cacti folders that show errors below."
msgstr "Nceda uqinisekise ukuba iseva yakho yewebhu inofikelelo lokufunda/ukubhala kwiifolda ze-cacti ezibonisa iimpazamo ngezantsi."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If SELinux is enabled on your server, you can either permanently disable this, or temporarily disable it and then add the appropriate permissions using the SELinux command-line tools."
msgstr "Ukuba i-SELinux ivuliwe kwiseva yakho, ungayivala ngokusisigxina, okanye uyivale okwethutyana uze wongeze iimvume ezifanelekileyo usebenzisa izixhobo zomgca womyalelo ze-SELinux."

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "The user '%s' should have MODIFY permission to enable read/write."
msgstr "Umsebenzisi '%s' kufuneka abe nemvume ye-MODIFY ukuze avumele ukufunda/ukubhala."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "An example of how to set folder permissions is shown here, though you may need to adjust this depending on your operating system, user accounts and desired permissions."
msgstr "Umzekelo wendlela yokuseta iimvume zefolda uboniswe apha, nangona kusenokufuneka uhlengahlengise oku ngokuxhomekeke kwinkqubo yakho yokusebenza, ii-akhawunti zabasebenzisi kunye neemvume ezifunwayo."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "EXAMPLE:"
msgstr "UMZEKELO:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Once installation has completed the CSRF path, should be set to read-only."
msgstr "Xa ufakelo lugqityiwe, indlela ye-CSRF kufuneka isetelwe ukufundwa kuphela."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "All folders are writable"
msgstr "Zonke iifolda ziyabhaleka"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Linux kernel security modules"
msgstr "Iimodyuli zokhuseleko ze-kernel ye-Linux"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti needs to establish network connections, execute binaries and write files to work. Linux security features such as <b>SELinux</b>, <b>AppArmor</b> or <b>ModSecurity</b> may cause Cacti to become inoperable in some configurations. If problems occur, check the settings of these security tools.<br/><br/>"
msgstr "I-Cacti idinga ukuseka uqhagamshelwano lwenethiwekhi, ukuqhuba ii-binaries kunye nokubhala iifayile ukuze isebenze. Iimpawu zokhuseleko ze-Linux ezifana ne-<b>SELinux</b>, <b>AppArmor</b> okanye <b>ModSecurity</b> zinokubangela ukuba i-Cacti ingasebenzi kolunye uqwalaselo. Ukuba iingxaki ziyenzeka, jonga iisetingi zezi zixhobo zokhuseleko.<br/><br/>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Input Validation Whitelist Protection"
msgstr "Ukhuseleko loLuhlu oluVunyiweyo loQinisekiso lweGalelo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti Data Input methods that call a script can be exploited in ways that a non-administrator can perform damage to either files owned by the poller account, and in cases where someone runs the Cacti poller as root, can compromise the operating system allowing attackers to exploit your infrastructure."
msgstr "Iindlela zeGalelo leDatha ye-Cacti ezibiza i-script zinokuxhatshazwa ngeendlela apho umntu ongengomlawuli anokwenza umonakalo kwiifayile ze-akhawunti ye-poller, kwaye kwiimeko apho umntu eqhuba i-poller ye-Cacti njenge-root, anokonakalisa inkqubo yokusebenza evumela abahlaseli ukuba baxhaphaze iziseko zakho zophuhliso."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Therefore, several versions ago, Cacti was enhanced to provide Whitelist capabilities on the these types of Data Input Methods.  Though this does secure Cacti more thoroughly, it does increase the amount of work required by the Cacti administrator to import and manage Templates and Packages."
msgstr "Ke ngoko, kwiinguqulelo ezininzi ezidlulileyo, i-Cacti yaphuculwa ukuze inikezele ngezakhono zoLuhlu oluVunyiweyo kwezi ntlobo zeeNdlela zeGalelo leDatha. Nangona oku kuyikhusela ngakumbi i-Cacti, kuyawandisa umthamo womsebenzi ofunekayo kumlawuli we-Cacti ukuze angenise kwaye alawule iiThempleyithi kunye neePakethe."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The way that the Whitelisting works is that when you first import a Data Input Method, or you re-import a Data Input Method, and the script and or arguments change in any way, the Data Input Method, and all the corresponding Data Sources will be immediately disabled until the administrator validates that the Data Input Method is valid."
msgstr "Indlela olusebenza ngayo uLuhlu oluVunyiweyo kukuba xa uqala ukungenisa iNdlela yeGalelo leDatha, okanye uphinda ungenise iNdlela yeGalelo leDatha, kwaye i-script kunye okanye ii-arguments zitshintsha nangayiphi na indlela, iNdlela yeGalelo leDatha, kunye nayo yonke iMithombo yeDatha ehambelanayo ziya kwenziwa zingasebenzi ngoko nangoko de umlawuli aqinisekise ukuba iNdlela yeGalelo leDatha isemthethweni."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "To make identifying Data Input Methods in this state, we have provided a validation script in Cacti's CLI directory that can be run with the following options:"
msgstr "Ukwenza lula ukuchonga iiNdlela zokuFaka iiDatha ezikwesi simo, sinikezele ngesikripthi sokuqinisekisa kulawulo lwe-CLI lwe-Cacti esinokuqhutywa ngezi khetho zilandelayo:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will search for any Data Input Methods that are currently banned and provide details as to why."
msgstr "Olu khetho lwesikripthi luya kukhangela naziphi na iiNdlela zokuFaka iiDatha ezivaliweyo ngoku kwaye lunike iinkcukacha zokuba kutheni."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option un-ban the Data Input Methods that are currently banned."
msgstr "Olu khetho lwesikripthi luyasusa ukuvalwa kweeNdlela zokuFaka iiDatha ezivaliweyo ngoku."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will re-enable any disabled Data Sources."
msgstr "Olu khetho lwesikripthi luya kuvula kwakhona nayiphi na iMithombo yeDatha ekhubaziweyo."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is strongly suggested that you update your config.php to enable this feature by uncommenting the <b>$input_whitelist</b> variable and then running the three CLI script options above after the web based install has completed.<br/><br/>"
msgstr "Kucetyiswa ngamandla ukuba uhlaziye i-config.php yakho ukuze wenze eli nqaku lisebenze ngokususa uphawu lwezimvo kwiguquguquki engu-<b>$input_whitelist</b> uze emva koko uqhube ezi khetho zintathu zesikripthi se-CLI zingentla emva kokuba ufakelo lwewebhu lugqityiwe.<br/><br/>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Check the Checkbox below to acknowledge that you have read and understand this security concern"
msgstr "Khangela ibhokisi yokutshekisha engezantsi ukuqinisekisa ukuba uyifundile kwaye uyayiqonda le nkxalabo yokhuseleko"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "I have read this statement"
msgstr "Ndiyifundile le ngxelo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Admin email address"
msgstr "Idilesi ye-imeyile yomlawuli"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "In case of problems cacti can send emails to the administrator. The address filled in here will be assigned to the admin account and \"Notify Primary Admin of Issue\" will be enabled. You can change this setting and the email address later. Do not forget to set up the email settings after installation."
msgstr "Xa kukho iingxaki i-Cacti ingathumela ii-imeyile kumlawuli. Idilesi efakwe apha iya kunikwa iakhawunti yomlawuli kwaye u-\"Yazisa uMlawuli oyiNtloko ngoMba\" uya kwenziwa asebenze. Ungalutshintsha olu seto kunye nedilesi ye-imeyile kamva. Ungalibali ukuseta iisetingi ze-imeyile emva kofakelo."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Profile"
msgstr "Iprofayili emiselweyo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the default Data Source Profile to be used for polling sources. This is the maximum amount of time between scanning devices for information so the lower the polling interval, the more work is placed on the Cacti Server host. Long retention profiles store more data, so they take up more disk capacity. Their advantage is that older data is not as consolidated and is therefore more accurate than using shorter retention."
msgstr "Nceda ukhethe iProfayili yoMthombo weDatha emiselweyo eza kusetyenziselwa ukuvota imithombo. Eli lixesha eliphezulu phakathi kokuskena izixhobo ukuze kufunyanwe ulwazi, ngoko ke okukhona lufutshane ixesha lokuvota, kokukhona uninzi lomsebenzi lubekwa kumamkeli weSeva ye-Cacti. Iiprofayili zokugcina ixesha elide zigcina idatha eninzi, ngoko ke zithatha umthamo omninzi wediski. Inzuzo yazo kukuba idatha endala ayihlanganiswanga kangako kwaye ngoko ichaneke ngakumbi kunokusebenzisa ixesha elifutshane lokugcina."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Also, select the intended, or configured Cron interval that you wish to use for Data Collection."
msgstr "Kwakhona, khetha ixesha le-Cron eliselicwangcisiweyo okanye elilungisiweyo ofuna ukulisebenzisela ukuQokelelwa kweDatha."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cron Interval"
msgstr "Ixesha le-Cron"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Automation Network"
msgstr "Uthungelwano oluZenzekelayo oluMiselweyo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti can automatically scan the network once installation has completed. This will utilise the network range below to work out the range of IPs that can be scanned.  A predefined set of options are defined for scanning which include using both 'public' and 'private' communities."
msgstr "I-Cacti ingaluskena ngokuzenzekelayo uthungelwano emva kokuba ufakelo lugqityiwe. Oku kuya kusebenzisa uluhlu lothungelwano olungezantsi ukufumanisa uluhlu lwee-IP ezinokuskenwa. Kukho iqela leenketho ezichazwe kwangaphambili zokuskena ezibandakanya ukusebenzisa zombini iindawo ze-'public' kunye ne-'private'."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If your devices require a different set of options to be used first, you may define them below and they will be utilized before the defaults"
msgstr "Ukuba izixhobo zakho zifuna iqela elahlukileyo leenketho ukuba lisetyenziswe kuqala, unokuzichaza ngezantsi kwaye ziya kusetyenziswa phambi kwezo zimiselweyo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "All options may be adjusted post installation"
msgstr "Zonke iinketho zingalungiswa emva kofakelo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Options"
msgstr "Iinketho eziMiselweyo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Scan Mode"
msgstr "Indlela yokuSkena"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Network Range"
msgstr "Uluhlu loThungelwano"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Additional Defaults"
msgstr "Iisetingi eziMiselweyo ezongezelelweyo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Additional SNMP Options"
msgstr "Iinketho ze-SNMP ezongezelelweyo"

