msgstr "Ufakelo alunakuqhubeka kuba akukho ziprofayili zifunyenweyo."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This may occur if you have a blank database and have not yet imported the cacti.sql file"
msgstr "Oku kunokwenzeka ukuba unesiseko sedatha esingenanto kwaye awukayingenisi ifayile ye-cacti.sql"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Template Setup"
msgstr "Useto lweThempleyithi"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the Device Templates that you wish to update during the Upgrade."
msgstr "Nceda ukhethe iiThempleyithi zeSixhobo ofuna ukuzihlaziya ngexesha loPhuculo."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Updating Templates that you have already made modifications to is not advisable.  The Upgrade of the Templates will NOT remove modifications to Graph and Data Templates, and can lead to unexpected behavior.  However, if you have not made changes to any Graph, Data Query, or Data Template, reimporting the Package should not have any affect.  In that case, you would have to 'Sync Graphs' to from the Templates after update."
msgstr "Ukuhlaziya iiThempleyithi osele wenze iinguqu kuzo akucetyiswa. Uphuculo lweeThempleyithi ALUYI kususa iinguqu ezikwiiThempleyithi zeGrafu kunye nezeDatha, kwaye kunokukhokelela kwindlela yokusebenza engalindelekanga. Nangona kunjalo, ukuba awenzanga lutshintsho nakweyiphi na iGrafu, uMbuzo weDatha, okanye iThempleyithi yeDatha, ukungenisa kwakhona iPhakheji akufuneki kube nesiphumo. Kule meko, kuya kufuneka wenze u-'Sync Graphs' ukusuka kwiiThempleyithi emva kohlaziyo."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the Device Templates that you wish to use after the Install.  If your Operating System is Windows, you need to ensure that you select the 'Windows Device' Template.  If your Operating System is Linux/UNIX, make sure you select the 'Local Linux Machine' Device Template."
msgstr "Nceda ukhethe iiThempleyithi zeSixhobo ofuna ukuzisebenzisa emva koFakelo. Ukuba iNkqubo yakho yokuSebenza yi-Windows, kufuneka uqinisekise ukuba ukhetha iThempleyithi ye-'Windows Device'. Ukuba iNkqubo yakho yokuSebenza yi-Linux/UNIX, qiniseka ukuba ukhetha iThempleyithi yeSixhobo ye-'Local Linux Machine'."

