msgstr "Izidluliselo"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Enable or Disable LDAP referrals.  If disabled, it may increase the speed of searches."
msgstr "Vula okanye uvale izidluliselo ze-LDAP. Ukuba zivaliwe, kunokunyusa isantya sokukhangela."

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Imowudi"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>One-Time Passwords (OTP/MFA)</i> - Cacti binds the user password only once, during final authentication.  <i>No Searching</i> performs no directory lookup and binds directly using the Distinguished Name (DN) template, so it is safe for OTP when the DN template alone identifies the user.  When a directory lookup is required to resolve the DN, use <i>Specific Searching</i> with a dedicated service account (or <i>Anonymous Searching</i> where the directory permits it) so the lookup never consumes the single-use code.  For resilient OTP deployments use a single DNS load balancer name in the Server(s) field rather than a space delimited multi-server list, which would re-attempt the bind with an already-consumed one-time password."
msgstr "Imowudi apho i-cacti iza kuzama ukuqinisekisa kwiseva ye-LDAP.<blockquote><i>Akukho Kukhangela</i> - Akukho kukhangela kwe-Distinguished Name (DN) okwenzekayo, zama nje ukudibanisa ngefomathi ye-Distinguished Name (DN) enikiweyo.<br><br><i>Ukukhangela Okungaziwayo</i> - Izama ukukhangela igama lomsebenzisi kwidirekthri ye-LDAP ngokudibanisa okungaziwayo ukufumana i-Distinguished Name (DN) yomsebenzisi.<br><br><i>Ukukhangela Okukhethekileyo</i> - Izama ukukhangela igama lomsebenzisi kwidirekthri ye-LDAP nge-Distinguished Name (DN) Ekhethekileyo kunye nePhasiwedi Ekhethekileyo yokudibanisa ukufumana i-Distinguished Name (DN) yomsebenzisi.<br><br><i>Iiphasiwedi Zexesha Elinye (OTP/MFA)</i> - I-Cacti idibanisa iphasiwedi yomsebenzisi kube kanye kuphela, ngexesha lokuqinisekisa lokugqibela. <i>Akukho Kukhangela</i> akwenzi ukhangelo lwedirekthri kwaye kudibanisa ngokuthe ngqo kusetyenziswa itempleyithi ye-Distinguished Name (DN), ngoko ke kukhuselekile kwi-OTP xa itempleyithi ye-DN yodwa ichonga umsebenzisi. Xa ukhangelo lwedirekthri lufunekayo ukusombulula i-DN, sebenzisa <i>Ukukhangela Okukhethekileyo</i> nge-akhawunti yenkonzo ezinikeleyo (okanye <i>Ukukhangela Okungaziwayo</i> apho idirekthri ikuvumelayo) ukuze ukhangelo lungaze lusebenzise ikhowudi yokusetyenziswa kanye. Ukuze ube nolwabiwo lwe-OTP olomeleleyo sebenzisa igama elinye le-DNS load balancer kwibala le-Server(s) kunoluhlu lweeseva ezininzi olwahlulwe ngesithuba, olunokuphinda luzame ukudibanisa ngephasiwedi yexesha elinye esele isetyenzisiwe."

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Igama eliKhethekileyo (DN)"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "The \"Distinguished Name\" syntax, applicable for both OpenLDAP and Windows AD configurations, offers flexibility in defining user identity. For OpenLDAP, the format follows this structure: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD provides an alternative syntax: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, commonly known as \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". In this context, \"&lt;username&gt;\" represents the specific username provided during the login prompt. This is particularly pertinent when operating in \"No Searching\" mode, or \"Require Group Membership\" enabled."
msgstr "Isakhiwo se-\"Gama eliKhethekileyo\" (Distinguished Name), esisebenza kuzo zombini iimilo ze-OpenLDAP kunye ne-Windows AD, sibonelela ngokuguquguquka ekuchazeni isazisi somsebenzisi. Kwi-OpenLDAP, ifomathi ilandela esi sakhiwo: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. I-Windows AD ibonelela ngesinye isakhiwo: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, esiqhelekileyo ukwaziwa ngokuba yi-\"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". Kulo mxholo, u-\"&lt;username&gt;\" umele igama lomsebenzisi elithile elinikwe ngexesha lomyalelo wokungena. Oku kubaluleke ngokukodwa xa usebenza kwimowudi ye-\"Akukho Kukhangela\", okanye xa \"Kufuneka ubuLungu beQela\" kuvuliwe."

#: login_providers.php
msgid "uid=<username>,ou=people,dc=example,dc=com"
msgstr "uid=<username>,ou=people,dc=example,dc=com"

#: login_providers.php user_admin.php
msgid "Group Membership"
msgstr "Ubulungu beQela"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Group Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "IGama eliKhethekileyo (DN) leQela"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Distinguished Name of the group that the user must be a member of in order to login. Leave blank to allow any successfully authenticated user to login."
msgstr "IGama eliKhethekileyo leqela ekufuneka umsebenzisi abe lilungu lalo ukuze akwazi ukungena. Shiya kungenanto ukuvumela nawuphi na umsebenzisi ongqinelwe ngempumelelo ukuba angene."

#: login_providers.php
msgid "ou=cacti-admins,dc=example,dc=com"
msgstr "ou=cacti-admins,dc=example,dc=com"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Group Member Attribute"
msgstr "Uphawu lweLungu leQela"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "This refers to the specific attribute within the LDAP directory that holds the usernames of group members. It is crucial to ensure that the attribute value aligns with the configuration specified in the \"Distinguished Name\" or that the actual attribute value is searchable using the settings outlined in the \"Distinguished Name\"."
msgstr "Oku kubhekisela kuphawu oluthile kulawulo lwe-LDAP olugcina amagama abasebenzisi bamalungu eqela. Kubalulekile ukuqinisekisa ukuba ixabiso lophawu lihambelana nolungiselelo oluchazwe kwi-\"Gama eliKhethekileyo\" okanye ukuba ixabiso lophawu lokwenene liyakwazi ukukhangelwa kusetyenziswa iisetingi ezichazwe kwi-\"Gama eliKhethekileyo\"."

#: login_providers.php
msgid "memberUid"
msgstr "memberUid"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Group Member Type"
msgstr "Uhlobo lweLungu leQela"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Defines if users use full Distinguished Name or just Username in the defined Group Member Attribute."
msgstr "Ichaza ukuba ngaba abasebenzisi basebenzisa iGama eliKhethekileyo elipheleleyo okanye iGama lomsebenzisi nje kuphela kuPhawu lweLungu leQela oluchaziweyo."

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Search Settings"
msgstr "Iisetingi zokuKhangela"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Search Base"
msgstr "Isiseko sokuKhangela"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Search base for searching the LDAP directory, such as <i>\"dc=win2kdomain,dc=local\"</i> or <i>\"ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>."
msgstr "Isiseko sokukhangela sokukhangela ulawulo lwe-LDAP, njenge-<i>\"dc=win2kdomain,dc=local\"</i> okanye i-<i>\"ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>."

#: login_providers.php
