msgstr "Ifayile egcina uGunyaziwe weSatifikethi se-SSL oza kusetyenziswa ukuqhagamshelana nesiseko sedatha esikude. Le yiparamitha yokuzikhethela enokufunwa ngumboneleli wesiseko sedatha ukuba baqalise i-SSL besebenzisa ukhetho oluthi --ssl-mode=VERIFY_CA."

