msgstr "Indlela yefayile eya kuvimba weefayile oqulathe izatifikethi ezithenjiweyo zoGunyaziwe weSatifikethi se-SSL. Le yiparamitha yokuzikhethela enokusetyenziswa endaweni yokunika indlela eya kwifayile enye yoGunyaziwe weSatifikethi. Le paramitha inokufunwa ngumboneleli wesiseko sedatha ukuba baqalise i-SSL besebenzisa ukhetho oluthi --ssl-mode=VERIFY_CA."

